فية تنفيذ معالجات الويب هوك الخاصة بستрайب في تطبيقات نيكست.جس مع مزامنة حالة الاشتراك في سوبر بيز للأدوات الذكية"},"definition":{"en":"stripe-supabase-webhooks is a skill providing patterns for implementing robust Stripe webhook handlers in Next.js App Router applications that sync subscription state to Supabase.","zh":"Stripe Supabase Webhooks 是一种 AI エージェント，用于在 Next.js App Router 应用中处理 Stripe webhook 事件","ja":"Stripe Supabase Webhooks は、Next.js App Router アプリケーションで Stripe webhook イベントを処理する AI エージェントです","ko":"Stripe Supabase Webhooks는 Next.js App Router 애플리케이션에서 Stripe webhook 이벤트를 처리하는 AI 에이전트입니다","es":"Un Webhook de Stripe es una función que escucha eventos de Stripe y actualiza el estado de suscripción en Supabase","fr":"Un Webhook Stripe est une fonction qui écoute les événements Stripe et met à jour l''état d''abonnement dans Supabase","de":"Ein Stripe-Webhook ist eine Funktion, die Stripe-Ereignisse abhört und den Abonnementstatus in Supabase aktualisiert","pt":"O Stripe Supabase Webhooks é um conjunto de padrões para implementar handlers de webhooks do Stripe em aplicações Next.js","ru":"Stripe Supabase Webhooks - это набор шаблонов для реализации обработчиков веб-хуков Stripe в приложениях Next.js","ar":"ستрайب سوبر بيز الويب هوك هو مجموعة من الأنماط لتنفيذ معالجات الويب هوك الخاصة بستрайب في تطبيقات نيكست.جس"},"features":{"en":["Implements signature verification for secure Stripe webhook handling","Dispatches events for intelligent upsert strategies in Supabase","Supports transactional email integration for automated notifications","Utilizes Next.js App Router for scalable and performant webhook handling","Syncs subscription state to Supabase for real-time data tracking","Provides patterns for robust Stripe webhook handlers in TypeScript"],"zh":["签名验证","事件分发","智能 upsert 策略","事务性电子邮件集成","Next.js App Router 支持","Supabase 同步"],"ja":["署名検証","イベントディスパッチ","インテリジェント upsert 戦略","トランザクション電子メール統合","Next.js App Router サポート","Supabase 同期"],"ko":["서명 확인","이벤트 디스패치","지능형 upsert 전략","트랜잭션 이메일 통합","Next.js App Router 지원","Supabase 동기화"],"es":["Verificación de firmas de Stripe","Dispatch de eventos","Estrategias de upsert inteligentes","Integración de correo electrónico transaccional","Implementación en aplicaciones Next.js con Supabase"],"fr":["Vérification de signature Stripe","Dispatch d''événements","Stratégies d''upsert intelligentes","Intégration de courrier électronique transactionnel","Mise en place dans des applications Next.js avec Supabase"],"de":["Signaturprüfung von Stripe","Ereignis-Dispatch","Intelligente Upset-Strategien","Transaktions-E-Mail-Integration","Implementierung in Next.js-Anwendungen mit Supabase"],"pt":["Verificação de assinatura do Stripe","Dispatch de eventos do Stripe","Estratégias de upsert inteligentes","Integração de email transacional","Suporte a aplicações Next.js com App Router"],"ru":["Проверка подписки Stripe","Диспетчеризация событий Stripe","Интеллектуальные стратегии upsert","Интеграция транзакционных писем","Поддержка приложений Next.js с App Router для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["تحقق من التوقيع الخاص بستрайب","توجيه أحداث سترايب","استراتيجيات إدراج ذكية","تكامل البريد الإلكتروني التعاقدي","دعم تطبيقات نيكست.جس مع روتر التطبيق للأدوات الذكية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use stripe-supabase-webhooks","stripe-supabase-webhooks setup guide","stripe-supabase-webhooks alternative","stripe-supabase-webhooks vs zapier","implementing stripe webhooks in next.js","supabase subscription state syncing","stripe webhook handler best practices","next.js app router stripe integration","transactional email integration with stripe"],"zh":["Stripe webhook","Supabase 同步","Next.js App Router","AI エージェント","签名验证","事件分发","智能 upsert 策略","事务性电子邮件集成"],"ja":["Stripe webhook","Supabase 同期","Next.js App Router","AI エージェント","署名検証","イベントディスパッチ","インテリジェント upsert 戦略","トランザクション電子メール統合"],"ko":["Stripe webhook","Supabase 동기화","Next.js App Router","AI 에이전트","서명 확인","이벤트 디스패치","지능형 upsert 전략","트랜잭션 이메일 통합"],"es":["Stripe Webhooks","Supabase","Next.js","Verificación de firmas","Estrategias de upsert","Correo electrónico transaccional","Integración de Stripe en Next.js","Herramientas de automatización de AI","Agentes de AI para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Webhooks Stripe","Supabase","Next.js","Vérification de signature","Stratégies d''upsert","Courrier électronique transactionnel","Intégration de Stripe dans Next.js","Outils d''automatisation d''IA","Agents d''IA pour les développeurs"],"de":["Stripe-Webhooks","Supabase","Next.js","Signaturprüfung","Upset-Strategien","Transaktions-E-Mail","Integration von Stripe in Next.js","Automatisierungstools von KI","KI-Agents für Entwickler"],"pt":["stripe supabase webhooks","next.js app router","assinatura do stripe","muralhas de webhooks","integração de email transacional","desenvolvimento de aplicações next.js"],"ru":["stripe supabase webhooks","next.js app router","подписка stripe","обработчики веб-хуков","интеграция транзакционных писем","разработка приложений next.js для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["ستрайب سوبر بيز الويب هوك","نيكست.جس روتر التطبيق","توقيع سترايب","معالجات الويب هوك","تكامل البريد الإلكتروني التعاقدي","تطوير تطبيقات نيكست.جس للأدوات الذكية"]}},"owner":"rrh1441","repo":"firstserveseattle","repoPath":"rrh1441/firstserveseattle","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.638Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"stripe-supabase-webhooks","description":"This skill should be used when implementing Stripe webhook handlers in Next.js App Router with Supabase database integration. It applies when handling subscription lifecycle events, syncing payment status to a database, implementing upsert logic with fallback strategies, or sending transactional emails on payment events. Triggers on requests involving Stripe webhooks, subscription management, payment event handling, or Supabase subscriber tables.","bodyPreview":"# Stripe Supabase Webhooks\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides patterns for implementing robust Stripe webhook handlers in Next.js App Router applications that sync subscription state to Supabase. It covers signature verification, event dispatching, intelligent upsert strategies, and transactional email integration.\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### 1. Route Handler Setup\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/stripe-webhook/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport Stripe from ''stripe'';\nim","body":"# Stripe Supabase Webhooks\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill provides patterns for implementing robust Stripe webhook handlers in Next.js App Router applications that sync subscription state to Supabase. It covers signature verification, event dispatching, intelligent upsert strategies, and transactional email integration.\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### 1. Route Handler Setup\n\n```typescript\n// app/api/stripe-webhook/route.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport Stripe from ''stripe'';\nimport { createClient } from ''@supabase/supabase-js'';\n\nexport const dynamic = ''force-dynamic''; // Disable edge caching\n\nconst stripe = new Stripe(process.env.STRIPE_SECRET_KEY!, {\n  apiVersion: ''2025-01-27.acacia'' as Stripe.LatestApiVersion,\n});\n\nconst supa = createClient(\n  process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,\n  process.env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY!, // Use service role for webhooks\n);\n```\n\n### 2. Webhook Signature Verification\n\nAlways verify signatures before processing:\n\n```typescript\nexport async function POST(req: NextRequest) {\n  const rawBody = Buffer.from(await req.arrayBuffer());\n  const sig = req.headers.get(''stripe-signature'') ?? '''';\n\n  let event: Stripe.Event;\n  try {\n    event = stripe.webhooks.constructEvent(\n      rawBody,\n      sig,\n      process.env.STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET!,\n    );\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.warn(''Signature verification failed:'', err);\n    return NextResponse.json({ error: ''Invalid signature'' }, { status: 400 });\n  }\n\n  // Process event...\n  return NextResponse.json({ received: true });\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Cascading Upsert Strategy\n\nWhen syncing Stripe data to Supabase, use a cascading lookup strategy to handle various user identification scenarios:\n\n```typescript\nasync function upsertSubscriber(fields: {\n  stripeCustomerId: string;\n  stripeSubscriptionId?: string;\n  userId?: string;        // From auth\n  email?: string;         // From Stripe customer\n  plan?: string;\n  status?: Stripe.Subscription.Status | ''expired'';\n  hasCard?: boolean;\n  trialEnd?: number | null;\n}) {\n  const updateData = {\n    stripe_customer_id: fields.stripeCustomerId,\n    stripe_subscription_id: fields.stripeSubscriptionId,\n    email: fields.email,\n    plan: fields.plan,\n    status: fields.status,\n    has_card: fields.hasCard,\n    trial_end: fields.trialEnd,\n    updated_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n  };\n\n  // Priority 1: Update by user_id (most reliable for authenticated users)\n  if (fields.userId) {\n    const { data: existing } = await supa\n      .from(''subscribers'')\n      .select(''id'')\n      .eq(''user_id'', fields.userId)\n      .maybeSingle();\n\n    if (existing) {\n      await supa.from(''subscribers'').update(updateData).eq(''user_id'', fields.userId);\n      return;\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Priority 2: Update by email (handles pre-signup records)\n  if (fields.email) {\n    const { data: existing } = await supa\n      .from(''subscribers'')\n      .select(''id'')\n      .eq(''email'', fields.email)\n      .maybeSingle();\n\n    if (existing) {\n      await supa.from(''subscribers'').update(updateData).eq(''email'', fields.email);\n      return;\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Priority 3: Upsert by stripe_customer_id (fallback)\n  await supa\n    .from(''subscribers'')\n    .upsert(updateData, { onConflict: ''stripe_customer_id'' });\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Event Type Handling\n\nHandle subscription lifecycle events with proper customer data retrieval:\n\n```typescript\nswitch (event.type) {\n  case ''checkout.session.completed'': {\n    const session = event.data.object as Stripe.Checkout.Session;\n    const custId = session.customer as string;\n    const subId = session.subscription as string;\n\n    const customer = await stripe.customers.retrieve(custId) as Stripe.Customer;\n    const subscription = await stripe.subscriptions.retrieve(subId);\n\n    await upsertSubscriber({\n      stripeCustomerId: custId,\n      stripeSubscriptionId: subId,\n      userId: session.metadata?.userId || session.client_reference_id,\n      email: customer.email ?? session.customer_details?.email ?? '''',\n      plan: planFromPrice(subscription.items.data[0]?.price.id ?? ''''),\n      status: subscription.status,\n      hasCard: true,\n      trialEnd: subscription.trial_end,\n    });\n\n    // Send welcome email\n    if (customer.email) {\n      await EmailService.sendWelcomeEmail(customer.email, plan);\n    }\n    break;\n  }\n\n  case ''customer.subscription.updated'': {\n    const sub = event.data.object as Stripe.Subscription;\n    const customer = await stripe.customers.retrieve(sub.customer as string) as Stripe.Customer;\n\n    await upsertSubscriber({\n      stripeCustomerId: sub.customer as string,\n      stripeSubscriptionId: sub.id,\n      email: customer.email ?? '''',\n      plan: planFromPrice(sub.items.data[0]?.price.id ?? ''''),\n      status: sub.status,\n      hasCard: cardOnFile(customer),\n      trialEnd: sub.trial_end,\n    });\n    break;\n  }\n\n  case ''customer.subscription.deleted'': {\n    const sub = event.data.object as Stripe.Subscription;\n    await upsertSubscriber({\n      stripeCustomerId: sub.customer as string,\n      stripeSubscriptionId: sub.id,\n      status: ''canceled'',\n      hasCard: false,\n    });\n    break;\n  }\n\n  case ''invoice.payment_succeeded'':\n  case ''invoice.payment_failed'': {\n    const inv = event.data.object as Stripe.Invoice;\n    const customer = await stripe.customers.retrieve(inv.customer as string) as Stripe.Customer;\n\n    await upsertSubscriber({\n      stripeCustomerId: inv.customer as string,\n      stripeSubscriptionId: inv.subscription as string | undefined,\n      email: customer.email ?? '''',\n      status: inv.status as Stripe.Subscription.Status,\n    });\n    break;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 5. Helper Functions\n\n```typescript\n/** Check if customer has payment method on file */\nfunction cardOnFile(cust: Stripe.Customer): boolean {\n  return Boolean(\n    cust.invoice_settings?.default_payment_method || cust.default_source\n  );\n}\n\n/** Map Stripe price ID to internal plan name */\nfunction planFromPrice(priceId: string): string {\n  const PRICE_MAP: Record<string, string> = {\n    [process.env.STRIPE_MONTHLY_PRICE_ID!]: ''monthly'',\n    [process.env.STRIPE_ANNUAL_PRICE_ID!]: ''annual'',\n  };\n  return PRICE_MAP[priceId] ?? ''unknown'';\n}\n```\n\n## Key Events to Handle\n\n| Event | When It Fires | Action |\n|-------|--------------|--------|\n| `checkout.session.completed` | Customer completes checkout | Create/update subscriber, send welcome email |\n| `customer.subscription.updated` | Any subscription change | Sync status, plan, trial_end |\n| `customer.subscription.deleted` | Subscription canceled/expired | Mark as canceled |\n| `payment_method.attached` | Card added | Update has_card flag |\n| `customer.updated` | Customer email/payment changes | Sync email and card status |\n| `invoice.payment_succeeded` | Successful renewal | Update status |\n| `invoice.payment_failed` | Failed payment | Update status, send failure email |\n\n## Database Schema Requirements\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE subscribers (\n  id UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),\n  user_id UUID UNIQUE REFERENCES auth.users(id),\n  email TEXT,\n  stripe_customer_id TEXT UNIQUE,\n  stripe_subscription_id TEXT,\n  plan TEXT CHECK (plan IN (''monthly'', ''annual'', ''unknown'')),\n  status TEXT,\n  has_card BOOLEAN DEFAULT false,\n  trial_end BIGINT,\n  created_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),\n  updated_at TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_subscribers_email ON subscribers(email);\nCREATE INDEX idx_subscribers_stripe_customer ON subscribers(stripe_customer_id);\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n```env\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...\nSTRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...\nSTRIPE_MONTHLY_PRICE_ID=price_...\nSTRIPE_ANNUAL_PRICE_ID=price_...\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxx.supabase.co\nSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...\n```\n\n## Testing Webhooks Locally\n\n```bash\n# Install Stripe CLI\nbrew install stripe/stripe-cli/stripe\n\n# Forward webhooks to local dev server\nstripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/stripe-webhook\n\n# Trigger test events\nstripe trigger checkout.session.completed\nstripe trigger customer.subscription.updated\nstripe trigger invoice.payment_failed\n```\n\n## References\n\nSee `references/event-handling.md` for detailed event payload examples and edge cases.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:40.052Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for E-commerce Agents needing robust Stripe webhook handling and Supabase integration.","zh":"非常适合需要强大的Stripe webhook处理和Supabase集成的电子商务代理。","ja":"StripeのWebhookハンドリングとSupabaseの統合が強力に必要な電子商取引エージェントに最適です。","ko":"강력한 Stripe 웹후크 처리 및 Supabase 통합이 필요한 전자상거래 에이전트에게 최적입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de comercio electrónico que necesitan un manejo robusto de Stripe webhook y integración con Supabase.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de commerce électronique ayant besoin d''une gestion robuste de Stripe webhook et d''intégration avec Supabase.","de":"Perfekt für E-Commerce-Agents, die eine robuste Stripe-Webhook-Verarbeitung und Supabase-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Comércio Eletrônico que precisam de tratamento robusto de webhooks da Stripe e integração com o Supabase.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов электронной коммерции, которым требуется надежная обработка веб-хуков Stripe и интеграция с Supabase.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التجاريين الإلكترونيين الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة قوية لشركة Stripe و إدماج Supabase."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement signature verification, event dispatching, and intelligent upsert strategies using Stripe and Supabase, streamlining subscription state management and transactional email integration with Next.js App Router applications.","zh":"赋予代理商使用Stripe和Supabase实现签名验证、事件调度和智能upsert策略的能力，简化订阅状态管理和事务性电子邮件与Next.js App Router应用程序的集成。","ja":"StripeとSupabaseを使用して、署名の検証、イベントのディスパッチ、インテリジェントなupsert戦略を実装し、Next.js App Routerアプリケーションとのサブスクリプション状態管理とトランザクション電子メールの統合を簡素化する。","ko":"에이전트가 스트라이프와 수퍼베이스를 사용하여 서명 확인, 이벤트 디스패치 및 지능형 업서트 전략을 구현할 수 있도록 하여 Next.js App Router 애플리케이션과 구독 상태 관리 및 트랜잭션 이메일 통합을 간소화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar la verificación de firmas, el envío de eventos y estrategias de actualización inteligentes utilizando Stripe y Supabase, lo que simplifica la administración de estados de suscripción y la integración de correo electrónico transaccional con aplicaciones de Next.js App Router.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre la vérification de signatures, l''envoi d''événements et des stratégies de mise à jour intelligentes en utilisant Stripe et Supabase, ce qui simplifie la gestion des états d''abonnement et l''intégration de courriels transactionnels avec des applications Next.js App Router.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Signaturen-Verifizierung, Ereignis-Dispatching und intelligente Upsert-Strategien mithilfe von Stripe und Supabase umzusetzen, wodurch die Verwaltung von Abonnementszuständen und die Integration von Transaktions-E-Mails mit Next.js App Router-Anwendungen gestreamlined wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar verificação de assinatura, despacho de eventos e estratégias de upsert inteligentes usando Stripe e Supabase, simplificando a gestão do estado de assinatura e a integração de e-mails transacionais com aplicações do Next.js App Router.","ru":"Позволяет агентам реализовывать проверку подписи, отправку событий и интеллектуальные стратегии upsert с использованием Stripe и Supabase, упрощая управление состоянием подписки и интеграцию транзакционных писем с приложениями Next.js App Router.","ar":"يتمكن الوكلاء من تنفيذ التحقق من التوقيع و إرسال الأحداث و استراتيجيات الإدراج الذكية باستخدام Stripe و Supabase، مما يبسّط إدارة حالة الإشتراك و دمج البريد الإلكتروني التعاقدي مع تطبيقات Next.js App Router."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure Stripe webhook handlers with signature verification","Syncing subscription states to Supabase for scalable e-commerce solutions","Integrating transactional emails with Stripe webhooks and Supabase"],"zh":["实现安全的Stripe webhook处理程序，具有签名验证","将订阅状态同步到Supabase以实现可扩展的电子商务解决方案","将事务性电子邮件与Stripe webhooks和Supabase集成"],"ja":["署名検証を備えた安全なStripe Webhookハンドラーを実装する","サブスクリプション状態をSupabaseに同期して、スケーラブルな電子商取引ソリューションを実現する","トランザクション電子メールをStripe WebhooksとSupabaseに統合する"],"ko":["서명 확인을 갖춘 보안 스트라이프 웹후크 처리기를 구현하는 것","구독 상태를 수퍼베이스에 동기화하여 확장 가능한 전자상거래 솔루션을 구현하는 것","트랜잭션 이메일을 스트라이프 웹후크 및 수퍼베이스와 통합하는 것"],"es":["Implementar controladores de Stripe webhook seguros con verificación de firmas","Sincronizar estados de suscripción con Supabase para soluciones de comercio electrónico escalables","Integrar correos electrónicos transaccionales con Stripe webhooks y Supabase"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des gestionnaires de Stripe webhook sécurisés avec vérification de signatures","Synchroniser les états d''abonnement avec Supabase pour des solutions de commerce électronique évolutives","Intégrer des courriels transactionnels avec Stripe webhooks et Supabase"],"de":["Sichere Stripe-Webhook-Handler mit Signaturen-Verifizierung implementieren","Abonnementszustände mit Supabase für skalierbare E-Commerce-Lösungen synchronisieren","Transaktions-E-Mails mit Stripe-Webhooks und Supabase integrieren"],"pt":["Implementação de tratadores de webhooks da Stripe seguros com verificação de assinatura","Sincronização dos estados de assinatura com o Supabase para soluções de comércio eletrônico escaláveis","Integração de e-mails transacionais com webhooks da Stripe e Supabase"],"ru":["Реализация безопасных обработчиков веб-хуков Stripe с проверкой подписи","Синхронизация состояний подписки с Supabase для масштабируемых решений электронной коммерции","Интеграция транзакционных писем с веб-хуками Stripe и Supabase"],"ar":["تنفيذ معالجات أمنية لشركة Stripe مع التحقق من التوقيع","مزامنة حالة الإشتراك مع Supabase للحلول التجارية الإلكترونية القابلة للتوسيع","إدماج البريد الإلكتروني التعاقدي معشركة Stripe و Supabase"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Stripe and Supabase accounts","Next.js App Router application required","Limited to Stripe and Supabase integrations"],"zh":["需要Stripe和Supabase账户","需要Next.js App Router应用程序","仅限于Stripe和Supabase集成"],"ja":["StripeおよびSupabaseアカウントが必要","Next.js App Routerアプリケーションが必要","StripeおよびSupabaseの統合のみに限定"],"ko":["스트라이프 및 수퍼베이스 계정이 필요합니다","Next.js App Router 애플리케이션이 필요합니다","스트라이프 및 수퍼베이스 통합만으로 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere cuentas de Stripe y Supabase","Se requiere una aplicación de Next.js App Router","Limitado a integraciones de Stripe y Supabase"],"fr":["Nécessite des comptes Stripe et Supabase","Une application Next.js App Router est requise","Limité aux intégrations de Stripe et Supabase"],"de":["Benötigt Stripe- und Supabase-Konten","Eine Next.js App Router-Anwendung ist erforderlich","Begrenzt auf Stripe- und Supabase-Integrationen"],"pt":["Requer contas da Stripe e do Supabase","Aplicação do Next.js App Router necessária","Limitado às integrações da Stripe e do Supabase"],"ru":["Требуется учетные записи Stripe и Supabase","Требуется приложение Next.js App Router","Ограничен интеграциями Stripe и Supabase"],"ar":["يتطلب حسابات Stripe و Supabase","تطبيق Next.js App Router مطلوب","محدود بإدماج Stripe و Supabase"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"81f909f9df0eeaa013ae4326b77f6637b1daf17ded842e37e61a38d19c6f5886","qualityScore":42}');
