django_error_handling_and_logging install","django error handling and logging tutorial","django_error_handling_and_logging alternative","django error handling and logging for AI agents"],"zh":["Django 错误处理","Django 日志记录","Python 错误处理","Django 6","企业级 Django","结构化日志","审计日志","异步错误处理"],"ja":["Django エラーハンドリング","Django ログ記録","Python エラーハンドリング","Django 6","エンタープライズ Django","構造化ログ","監査ログ","非同期エラーハンドリング"],"ko":["Django 오류 처리","Django 로깅","Python 오류 처리","Django 6","기업용 Django","구조화된 로그","감사 로그","비동기 오류 처리"],"es":["manejo de errores django","registro en django","errores graphql","configuración de registro estructurado","registro de auditoría","monitoreo de errores","herramientas de ai para desarrollo","agentes de ai para django"],"fr":["gestion des erreurs django","journalisation dans django","erreurs graphql","configuration de la journalisation structurée","journalisation d''audit","surveillance des erreurs","outils d''ia pour le développement","agents d''ia pour django"],"de":["Fehlerbehandlung in Django","Protokollierung in Django","GraphQL-Fehler","Konfiguration der strukturierten Protokollierung","Protokollierung von Audits","Fehlerüberwachung","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","KI-Agents für Django"],"pt":["tratamento de erros django","logging django","padrões de tratamento de erros","respostas de erro consistentes","logs estruturados","django 6","erros graphql","logging de auditoria"],"ru":["обработка ошибок django","логирование django","стандарты обработки ошибок","последовательные ответы на ошибки","структурированные журналы","django 6","ошибки graphql","логирование аудита"],"ar":["معالجة الأخطاء django","تسجيل الدخول django","معايير معالجة الأخطاء","استجابات الخطأ المتسقة","سجلات منظمة","django 6","أخطاء graphql","تسجيل مراجعة"]}},"owner":"Poneaswaran","repo":"College-Management-System-Backend","repoPath":"Poneaswaran/College-Management-System-Backend","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T12:28:50Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"django_error_handling_and_logging","description":"Enterprise Django 6 error handling and logging — structured logging, exception hierarchy, GraphQL error standardization, and observability.","bodyPreview":"# Django Error Handling and Logging Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nDefine and enforce error handling and logging standards for enterprise Django 6 systems, ensuring consistent error responses, structured logging, audit trails, and observability.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Exception hierarchy and custom exceptions\n- Error handling in services, resolvers, and views\n- GraphQL error standardization\n- Structured logging configuration\n- Audit logging\n- Error monitoring and alerting\n- Async error handling\n\n## Responsibilities","body":"# Django Error Handling and Logging Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nDefine and enforce error handling and logging standards for enterprise Django 6 systems, ensuring consistent error responses, structured logging, audit trails, and observability.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Exception hierarchy and custom exceptions\n- Error handling in services, resolvers, and views\n- GraphQL error standardization\n- Structured logging configuration\n- Audit logging\n- Error monitoring and alerting\n- Async error handling\n\n## Responsibilities\n\n1. ENFORCE structured, JSON-formatted logging in production.\n2. ENFORCE custom exception hierarchy for domain errors.\n3. ENFORCE standardized error responses in GraphQL.\n4. ENFORCE audit logging for sensitive operations.\n5. PREVENT stack trace leakage to clients.\n6. PREVENT silent error swallowing.\n\n---\n\n## Mandatory Rules\n\n### ALWAYS\n\n1. ALWAYS use Python''s `logging` module. Never use `print()`.\n2. ALWAYS use structured JSON logging in production:\n   ```python\n   LOGGING = {\n       ''version'': 1,\n       ''disable_existing_loggers'': False,\n       ''formatters'': {\n           ''json'': {\n               ''()'': ''pythonjsonlogger.jsonlogger.JsonFormatter'',\n               ''format'': ''%(asctime)s %(name)s %(levelname)s %(message)s %(pathname)s %(lineno)d'',\n           },\n       },\n       ''handlers'': {\n           ''console'': {''class'': ''logging.StreamHandler'', ''formatter'': ''json''},\n       },\n       ''loggers'': {\n           ''django'': {''handlers'': [''console''], ''level'': ''WARNING''},\n           ''notifications'': {''handlers'': [''console''], ''level'': ''INFO''},\n           ''audit'': {''handlers'': [''console''], ''level'': ''INFO''},\n       },\n       ''root'': {''handlers'': [''console''], ''level'': ''INFO''},\n   }\n   ```\n3. ALWAYS define a custom exception hierarchy for domain errors:\n   ```python\n   # core/exceptions.py\n   class AppError(Exception):\n       \"\"\"Base exception for all application errors.\"\"\"\n       def __init__(self, message: str, code: str = \"INTERNAL_ERROR\"):\n           self.message = message\n           self.code = code\n           super().__init__(message)\n\n   class NotFoundError(AppError):\n       def __init__(self, resource: str, identifier):\n           super().__init__(f\"{resource} not found: {identifier}\", code=\"NOT_FOUND\")\n\n   class PermissionDeniedError(AppError):\n       def __init__(self, message: str = \"Permission denied\"):\n           super().__init__(message, code=\"PERMISSION_DENIED\")\n\n   class ValidationError(AppError):\n       def __init__(self, message: str, field: str = None):\n           self.field = field\n           super().__init__(message, code=\"VALIDATION_ERROR\")\n\n   class ConflictError(AppError):\n       def __init__(self, message: str):\n           super().__init__(message, code=\"CONFLICT\")\n   ```\n4. ALWAYS catch specific exceptions. Never use bare `except:` or `except Exception:` without re-raising:\n   ```python\n   # CORRECT\n   try:\n       notification = Notification.objects.get(id=nid, recipient=user)\n   except Notification.DoesNotExist:\n       raise NotFoundError(\"Notification\", nid)\n\n   # WRONG\n   try:\n       ...\n   except:\n       pass\n   ```\n5. ALWAYS log exceptions with full traceback at ERROR level:\n   ```python\n   try:\n       result = service.process(data)\n   except AppError:\n       raise  # Domain errors propagate normally\n   except Exception:\n       logger.exception(\"Unexpected error in process()\")  # Logs full traceback\n       raise AppError(\"An unexpected error occurred\")\n   ```\n6. ALWAYS return standardized error responses from GraphQL resolvers:\n   ```python\n   @strawberry.mutation(permission_classes=[IsAuthenticated])\n   def mark_read(self, info: Info, notification_id: int) -> NotificationType | None:\n       try:\n           notification = notification_service.mark_as_read(notification_id, info.context[\"request\"].user)\n           return NotificationType.from_model(notification)\n       except NotFoundError:\n           return None\n       except PermissionDeniedError:\n           return None\n       except Exception:\n           logger.exception(f\"Error marking notification {notification_id} as read\")\n           return None\n   ```\n7. ALWAYS include contextual information in log messages:\n   ```python\n   logger.info(\"Notification created\", extra={\n       \"notification_id\": notification.id,\n       \"recipient_id\": notification.recipient_id,\n       \"notification_type\": notification.notification_type,\n       \"actor_id\": actor.id if actor else None,\n   })\n   ```\n8. ALWAYS use separate loggers for different concerns:\n   ```python\n   logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)        # Module-level logger\n   audit_logger = logging.getLogger(''audit'')    # Audit events\n   perf_logger = logging.getLogger(''performance'')  # Performance metrics\n   ```\n9. ALWAYS use `logger.exception()` (not `logger.error()`) when logging caught exceptions — it includes the traceback.\n10. ALWAYS set appropriate log levels:\n    - `DEBUG`: Detailed diagnostic info (dev only)\n    - `INFO`: Routine operations (notification created, task started)\n    - `WARNING`: Unexpected but recoverable situations (cache miss, retry)\n    - `ERROR`: Failures requiring attention (DB error, external API failure)\n    - `CRITICAL`: System-level failures (Redis down, DB connection lost)\n\n### NEVER\n\n1. NEVER use `print()` for logging or debugging.\n2. NEVER use bare `except:` or `except Exception: pass`.\n3. NEVER log sensitive data: passwords, tokens, API keys, full credit card numbers, SSNs.\n4. NEVER expose internal stack traces, file paths, or SQL queries in API responses.\n5. NEVER silently swallow exceptions without logging.\n6. NEVER use string formatting in logger calls — use lazy formatting:\n   ```python\n   # CORRECT — lazy formatting, evaluated only if log level is active\n   logger.info(\"User %s created notification %s\", user_id, notification_id)\n   # ALSO CORRECT — extra dict\n   logger.info(\"Notification created\", extra={\"user_id\": user_id, \"notif_id\": notification_id})\n   # WRONG — always evaluated, even if log level is disabled\n   logger.debug(f\"Processing {expensive_computation()}\")\n   ```\n7. NEVER log at ERROR level for expected business conditions (e.g., validation failures). Use WARNING or INFO.\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling Layers\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│ GraphQL Resolver            │  Catch AppError → return structured response\n│                             │  Catch Exception → log, return generic error\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Service Layer               │  Raise AppError subclasses for business errors\n│                             │  Let unexpected exceptions propagate\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Model Layer                 │  Raise Django ValidationError in clean()\n│                             │  Raise IntegrityError on constraint violations\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│ Database                    │  Raises OperationalError, IntegrityError\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## Audit Logging\n\nLog these events to the `audit` logger:\n- Authentication: login, logout, failed login, password change\n- Authorization: permission denied events\n- Data mutations: create, update, delete of sensitive models\n- Admin actions: role changes, user management\n- Configuration changes: feature flags, settings updates\n\nFormat:\n```python\naudit_logger.info(\"action_performed\", extra={\n    \"timestamp\": timezone.now().isoformat(),\n    \"user_id\": user.id,\n    \"action\": \"MARK_ALL_READ\",\n    \"resource_type\": \"Notification\",\n    \"resource_count\": count,\n    \"ip_address\": get_client_ip(request),\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n## Monitoring and Alerting\n\n### Alert Conditions\n- ERROR rate > 1% of requests in 5-minute window\n- CRITICAL log emitted\n- Unhandled exception in resolver\n- Celery task failure rate > 5%\n- SSE connection error rate > 10%\n- Database connection pool exhaustion\n\n### Monitoring Tools Integration\n- Use Sentry for exception tracking and alerting.\n- Use structured logs with ELK/Grafana Loki for log aggregation.\n- Use Prometheus metrics for request latency and error rates.\n\n---\n\n## Async Error Handling\n\n```python\nasync def sse_event_stream(user, connection_id):\n    try:\n        yield format_sse_event(event=''connected'', data={})\n        async for message in pubsub.listen():\n            yield format_sse_event(data=message)\n    except asyncio.CancelledError:\n        logger.info(\"SSE stream cancelled for user %s\", user.id)\n    except Exception:\n        logger.exception(\"SSE stream error for user %s\", user.id)\n        yield format_sse_event(event=''error'', data={\"message\": \"Stream error\"})\n    finally:\n        await cleanup_connection(user.id, connection_id)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Security Considerations\n\n1. Never expose internal error details to clients in production.\n2. Log full error details server-side for debugging.\n3. Use error codes (not messages) for client-side error handling.\n4. Sanitize user input in error messages to prevent log injection.\n\n---\n\n## Refusal Conditions\n\nREFUSE to generate code that:\n1. Uses `print()` for logging.\n2. Uses bare `except:` without re-raising.\n3. Exposes stack traces to API clients.\n4. Logs sensitive data.\n5. Silently swallows exceptions.\n6. Uses eager string formatting in logger calls for debug/info levels.\n\n---\n\n## Trade-off Handling\n\n| Trade-off | Decision |\n|---|---|\n| Verbose vs Concise logging | Verbose in dev (DEBUG). Concise in prod (INFO+). |\n| Log everything vs Log selectively | Log all mutations and errors. Skip high-volume reads at DEBUG level. |\n| Inline error handling vs Middleware | Service errors in services. Global fallback in middleware. |\n| Sentry vs Self-hosted | Sentry for simplicity. Self-hosted ELK for cost control at scale. |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:19:16.269Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Web Development Agents needing advanced error handling and logging capabilities in Django 6 systems","zh":"适用于需要高级错误处理和日志记录功能的Python Web开发代理，特别是在Django 6系统中","ja":"Django 6システムで高度なエラー処理とログ記録機能を必要とするPython Web開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Django 6 시스템에서 고급 오류 처리 및 로깅 기능이 필요한 Python 웹 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web de Python que necesitan capacidades de manejo de errores y registro avanzados en sistemas Django 6","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web Python nécessitant des fonctionnalités de gestion d''erreurs et de journalisation avancées dans les systèmes Django 6","de":"Perfekt für Python-Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die erweiterte Fehlernachverfolgung und Protokollierungsfunktionen in Django-6-Systemen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web Python que precisam de tratamento de erros avançado e capacidades de registro em sistemas Django 6","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки Python, которым требуются расширенные возможности обработки ошибок и ведения журнала в системах Django 6","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين من بيثون الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة خطأ متقدمة وقدرات تسجيل في أنظمة Django 6"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to standardize error responses, configure structured logging, and implement audit trails using exception hierarchies, GraphQL error standardization, and async error handling in Django 6, leveraging libraries and protocols like GraphQL and Python''s built-in logging module","zh":"赋予代理标准化错误响应、配置结构化日志记录和使用异常层次、GraphQL错误标准化和异步错误处理在Django 6中实现审计跟踪，利用如GraphQL和Python内置日志模块的库和协议","ja":"エージェントに、Django 6で例外階層、GraphQLエラースタンダード化、非同期エラーハンドリングを使用して、エラー応答を標準化し、構造化ログ記録と監査トレイルを構成する能力を付与し、GraphQLやPythonのビルトインログモジュールなどのライブラリとプロトコルを活用","ko":"에이전트가 Django 6에서 예외 계층, GraphQL 오류 표준화, 비동기 오류 처리를 사용하여 오류 응답을 표준화하고, 구조화된 로깅 및 감사 추적을 구성할 수 있도록 하며, GraphQL 및 Python의 내장 로깅 모듈과 같은 라이브러리 및 프로토콜을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a estandarizar respuestas de errores, configurar registros estructurados e implementar auditorías utilizando jerarquías de excepciones, estandarización de errores GraphQL y manejo de errores asíncronos en Django 6, aprovechando bibliotecas y protocolos como GraphQL y el módulo de registro integrado de Python","fr":"Permet aux agents de normaliser les réponses d''erreur, de configurer la journalisation structurée et de mettre en œuvre des audits en utilisant des hiérarchies d''exceptions, une normalisation des erreurs GraphQL et un traitement d''erreurs asynchrone dans Django 6, en exploitant des bibliothèques et des protocoles comme GraphQL et le module de journalisation intégré de Python","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Fehlerantworten zu standardisieren, strukturierte Protokollierung zu konfigurieren und Audits mithilfe von Ausnahmehierarchien, GraphQL-Fehlerstandardisierung und asynchroner Fehlernachverfolgung in Django 6 zu implementieren, indem es Bibliotheken und Protokolle wie GraphQL und das in Python integrierte Protokollierungsmodul nutzt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a padronizar respostas de erros, configurar registro estruturado e implementar rastros de auditoria usando hierarquias de exceções, padronização de erros GraphQL e tratamento de erros assíncrono em Django 6, aproveitando bibliotecas e protocolos como GraphQL e o módulo de registro embutido do Python","ru":"Позволяет агентам стандартизировать ответы об ошибках, настраивать структурированное ведение журнала и реализовывать аудиторские следы с помощью иерархий исключений, стандартизации ошибок GraphQL и асинхронного обработки ошибок в Django 6, используя библиотеки и протоколы, такие как GraphQL и встроенный модуль ведения журнала Python","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توحيد استجابات الأخطاء ، وتكوين سجلات متسلسلة ، وتنفيذ مسارات التدقيق باستخدام هرميات الاستثناء ، ومعيار أخطاء GraphQL ، ومعالجة الخطأ غير المتزامنة في Django 6 ، باستخدام مكتبات وبروتوكولات مثل GraphQL ووحدة التسجيل المدمجة في Python"},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing error handling in Django services, resolvers, and views","Implementing structured logging and audit logging for enterprise systems","Debugging and monitoring errors in Django applications using async error handling and error monitoring tools"],"zh":["在Django服务、解析器和视图中标准化错误处理","为企业系统实现结构化日志记录和审计日志记录","使用异步错误处理和错误监控工具调试和监控Django应用程序中的错误"],"ja":["Djangoサービス、リゾルバ、ビューでのエラーハンドリングの標準化","エンタープライズシステムのための構造化ログ記録と監査ログ記録の実装","非同期エラーハンドリングとエラーモニタリングツールを使用したDjangoアプリケーションのエラーのデバッグと監視"],"ko":["Django 서비스, 해석기, 뷰에서 오류 처리를 표준화","기업 시스템을 위한 구조화된 로깅 및 감사 로깅 구현","비동기 오류 처리 및 오류 모니터링 도구를 사용하여 Django 애플리케이션의 오류를 디버깅 및 모니터링"],"es":["Estandarizar el manejo de errores en servicios, resolutores y vistas de Django","Implementar registro estructurado y registro de auditoría para sistemas empresariales","Depurar y supervisar errores en aplicaciones de Django utilizando manejo de errores asíncronos y herramientas de seguimiento de errores"],"fr":["Normaliser la gestion des erreurs dans les services, les résolveurs et les vues de Django","Mettre en œuvre la journalisation structurée et la journalisation d''audit pour les systèmes d''entreprise","Déboguer et surveiller les erreurs dans les applications Django en utilisant le traitement d''erreurs asynchrone et les outils de surveillance des erreurs"],"de":["Standardisieren der Fehlernachverfolgung in Django-Diensten, -Resolvery und -Ansichten","Implementieren von strukturierter Protokollierung und Audit-Protokollierung für Unternehmenssysteme","Fehler in Django-Anwendungen mithilfe asynchroner Fehlernachverfolgung und Fehlernachverfolgungstools debuggen und überwachen"],"pt":["Padronizar tratamento de erros em serviços Django, resolvers e views","Implementar registro estruturado e registro de auditoria para sistemas empresariais","Depurar e monitorar erros em aplicações Django usando tratamento de erros assíncrono e ferramentas de monitoramento de erros"],"ru":["Стандартизировать обработку ошибок в сервисах Django, решателях и представлениях","Реализовать структурированное ведение журнала и аудиторское ведение журнала для корпоративных систем","Отладить и контролировать ошибки в приложениях Django с помощью асинхронного обработки ошибок и инструментов мониторинга ошибок"],"ar":["توحيد معالجة الأخطاء في خدمات Django و المحللات و المشاهد","تنفيذ سجلات متسلسلة وتسجيل تدقيق لنظم الشركات","تصحيح الأخطاء ومراقبتها في تطبيقات Django باستخدام معالجة الخطأ غير المتزامنة وأدوات مراقبة الأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Django 6 system setup","Limited to Python-based web development","Needs configuration for custom exceptions and error handling"],"zh":["需要Django 6系统设置","仅限Python基于的Web开发","需要自定义异常和错误处理的配置"],"ja":["Django 6システムの設定が必要","PythonベースのWeb開発のみ","カスタム例外とエラーハンドリングの設定が必要"],"ko":["Django 6 시스템 설정이 필요","Python 기반 웹 개발만","사용자 정의 예외 및 오류 처리를 위한 구성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de sistema Django 6","Limitado al desarrollo web basado en Python","Requiere configuración para excepciones personalizadas y manejo de errores"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de système Django 6","Limité au développement web basé sur Python","Nécessite une configuration pour les exceptions personnalisées et la gestion des erreurs"],"de":["Benötigt eine Django-6-Systemkonfiguration","Begrenzt auf Python-basierte Webentwicklung","Benötigt eine Konfiguration für benutzerdefinierte Ausnahmen und Fehlernachverfolgung"],"pt":["Exige configuração do sistema Django 6","Limitado ao desenvolvimento web baseado em Python","Necessita de configuração para exceções personalizadas e tratamento de erros"],"ru":["Требует настройки системы Django 6","Ограничен веб-разработкой на основе Python","Требует настройки для пользовательских исключений и обработки ошибок"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد نظام Django 6","محدود بالتطوير الويب المستند إلى بيثون","يحتاج إلى إعداد لاستثناءات مخصصة ومعالجة الأخطاء"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5dcecf4ede4316ba0833e111399c1def4bf22880227f5cc179e94aab556d5315","qualityScore":42}');
DELETE FROM skills_fts WHERE id = 'Poneaswaran/College-Management-System-Backend/django_error_handling_and_logging';
INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('Poneaswaran/College-Management-System-Backend/django_error_handling_and_logging', 'django_error_handling_and_logging', 'Poneaswaran', 'College-Management-System-Backend', 'community', 'django_error_handling_and_logging Poneaswaran College-Management-System-Backend community The django_error_handling_and_logging skill defines and enforces error handling and logging standards for enterprise Django 6 systems, benefiting developers and DevOps teams. Django 错误处理和日志记录技能提供了一致的错误响应和结构化日志，适用于企业级 Django 6 系统 Django エラーハンドリングとログ記録スキルは、エンタープライズ Django 6 システム用に一貫したエラー応答と構造化ログを提供します Django 오류 처리 및 로깅 스킬은 기업용 Django 6 시스템을 위한 일관된 오류 응답 및 구조화된 로그를 제공합니다 El manejo de errores y la registrazione en Django 6 son cruciales para la observabilidad y la respuesta a errores. Esta guía cubre la jerarquía de excepciones, el manejo de errores en servicios y vistas, y la configuración de registro estructurado La gestion des erreurs et la journalisation dans Django 6 sont essentielles pour l''observabilité et la réponse aux erreurs. Ce guide couvre la hiérarchie des exceptions, la gestion des erreurs dans les services et les vues, et la configuration de la journalisation structurée Die Fehlerbehandlung und Protokollierung in Django 6 sind entscheidend für die Observierbarkeit und die Fehlerreaktion. Diese Anleitung behandelt die Ausnahmehierarchie, die Fehlerbehandlung in Diensten und Ansichten sowie die Konfiguration der strukturierten Protokollierung O tratamento de erros e logging no Django é crucial para sistemas empresariais. Aprenda a definir e impor padrões para respostas de erro consistentes e logs estruturados. Обработка ошибок и логирование в Django имеют решающее значение для корпоративных систем. Узнайте, как определить и обеспечить стандарты для последовательных ответов на ошибки и структурированных журналов. معالجة الأخطاء وتسجيل الدخول في Django مهمة لأنظمة الشركات. تعلم كيفية تعريف ومعايير لاستجابات الخطأ المتسقة وسجلات منظمة. django error handling and logging how to use django_error_handling_and_logging django_error_handling_and_logging setup guide django error handling best practices django_error_handling_and_logging vs logging frameworks django_error_handling_and_logging install django error handling and logging tutorial django_error_handling_and_logging alternative django error handling and logging for AI agents Django 错误处理 Django 日志记录 Python 错误处理 Django 6 企业级 Django 结构化日志 审计日志 异步错误处理 Defines exception hierarchy and custom exceptions for Django 6 systems Implements error handling in services, resolvers, and views Standardizes GraphQL error responses for consistent error handling Configures structured logging for improved observability Enables audit logging and error monitoring for enhanced security django_error_handling_and_logging is a skill that standardizes error handling and logging for Django 6 systems, ensuring consistent error responses and structured logging.');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('EthanAlgoX/MarketBot/gog', 'community', 'EthanAlgoX', 'MarketBot', 'EthanAlgoX/MarketBot', 'gog', 0, 0, 42, '2026-03-07T12:46:33.370Z', '2026-03-07T12:50:42.538Z', '4882b9f7160c6a8b3692e1b001a1df9aa0835908cac934bed3f33361f73fbfe6', '{"id":"EthanAlgoX/MarketBot/gog","name":"gog","description":{"en":"The gog skill is a finance-customized AI agent for market intelligence, trading analysis, and decision support, built on openclaw. It benefits developers and financial analysts","zh":"gog 是一个命令行工具，用于集成 Gmail、Calendar、Drive 等服务，通过 OAuth 进行授权","ja":"gog は、Gmail、Calendar、Drive などのサービスを統合するためのコマンドラインツールで、OAuth を使用して認証を行う","ko":"gog는 Gmail, Calendar, Drive 등의 서비스를 통합하기 위한 명령줄 도구로서 OAuth를 사용하여 인증을 수행한다","es":"gog es una herramienta de línea de comandos para interactuar con servicios de Google como Gmail y Calendar. Requiere configuración de OAuth","fr":"gog est un outil en ligne de commande pour interagir avec les services Google tels que Gmail et Calendar. Nécessite une configuration OAuth","de":"gog ist ein Kommandozeilen-Tool für die Interaktion mit Google-Diensten wie Gmail und Calendar. Benötigt OAuth-Konfiguration","pt":"O gog é uma ferramenta de automação de tarefas que utiliza OAuth para gerenciar e-mails e calendários. Aprenda a configurá-lo com comandos como gog auth e gog gmail search","ru":"gog - это инструмент для автоматизации задач, использующий OAuth для управления электронной почтой и календарями. Узнайте, как настроить его с помощью команд gog auth и gog gmail search","ar":"gog هو أداة لتشغيل المهام الآلية التي تستخدم OAuth لإدارة البريد الإلكتروني والتقويم. تعلم كيفية إعداده باستخدام أوامر مثل gog auth و gog gmail search"},"seo":{"title":{"en":"gog: OAuth Setup Guide for AI Agents","zh":"gog Setup Guide: Gmail/Calendar/Drive API 集成","ja":"gog セットアップガイド: Gmail/Calendar/Drive API 統合","ko":"gog 설정 가이드: Gmail/Calendar/Drive API 통합","es":"Guía de configuración de gog para Gmail y Calendar","fr":"Configurer gog pour Gmail et Calendar: Meilleures pratiques","de":"gog-Setup-Anleitung für Gmail, Calendar und OAuth","pt":"Guia de Configuração do gog: Automação de Tarefas com OAuth","ru":"Настройка gog: Руководство по использованию ИИ Агентов дл...","ar":"دليل إعداد gog: إدارة البريد الإلكتروني والتقويم باستخدام..."},"description":{"en":"Unlock gog''s full potential with our expert setup guide. Learn how to authenticate with OAuth and harness its market intelligence capabilities","zh":"了解 gog 的功能和用途，实现 Gmail、Calendar、Drive 等服务的自动化和集成，提升开发效率","ja":"gog の機能と用途を理解し、Gmail、Calendar、Drive などのサービスを自動化して統合することで開発効率を向上させる","ko":"gog의 기능과 용途를 이해하고, Gmail, Calendar, Drive 등의 서비스를 자동화하여 통합하여 개발 효율성을 향상시키는 방법","es":"Aprende a configurar gog para Gmail, Calendar y otros servicios de Google con OAuth. Descubre los comandos y características clave de gog","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer gog pour Gmail, Calendar et d''autres services Google avec OAuth. Explorez les commandes et fonctionnalités clés de gog","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie gog für Gmail, Calendar und andere Google-Dienste mit OAuth konfigurieren. Entdecken Sie die wichtigsten Befehle und Funktionen von gog","pt":"Aprenda a configurar o gog para automação de tarefas de e-mail e calendário com OAuth. Descubra como usar comandos como gog gmail search e gog auth","ru":"Узнайте, как настроить gog для автоматизации задач электронной почты и календаря с помощью OAuth. Откройте для себя команды gog gmail search и gog auth","ar":"تعرف على كيفية إعداد gog لتشغيل المهام الآلية لبريد الإلكتروني والتقويم باستخدام OAuth. استكشف أوامر مثل gog gmail search و gog auth"},"definition":{"en":"gog is a dedicated AI agent for market intelligence, trading analysis, and decision support, utilizing OAuth for authentication","zh":"gog 是一个 AI エージェント，用于 Gmail/Calendar/Drive API 的自动化和集成","ja":"gog は AI エージェントで、Gmail/Calendar/Drive API の自動化と統合に使用される","ko":"gog는 Gmail/Calendar/Drive API의 자동화 및 통합을 위한 AI 에이전트이다","es":"gog es un agente de inteligencia artificial para interactuar con servicios de Google","fr":"gog est un agent IA pour interagir avec les services Google","de":"gog ist ein künstlicher Intelligenz-Agent für die Interaktion mit Google-Diensten","pt":"O gog é uma ferramenta de linha de comando que utiliza OAuth para automação de tarefas de e-mail e calendário","ru":"gog - это инструмент командной строки, использующий OAuth для автоматизации задач электронной почты и календаря","ar":"gog هو أداة سطر الأوامر التي تستخدم OAuth لتشغيل المهام الآلية لبريد الإلكتروني والتقويم"},"features":{"en":["Requires OAuth setup using client_secret.json","Supports authentication with multiple Google services: Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Docs, Sheets","Enables Gmail search using commands like ''gog gmail search ''newer_than:7d''''","Allows Gmail messages search per email, ignoring threading, with commands like ''gog gmail messages search \"in:inbox from:ryanair.com\"''","Supports sending plain Gmail messages using ''gog gmail send'' command"],"zh":["支持 Gmail 搜索和消息搜索","支持 Calendar 和 Drive 服务的集成","通过 OAuth 进行授权","支持多账户管理","提供命令行工具进行快速操作"],"ja":["Gmail 検索とメッセージ検索をサポート","Calendar と Drive サービスの統合をサポート","OAuth を使用して認証を行う","複数アカウントの管理をサポート","コマンドラインツールによる迅速な操作を提供"],"ko":["Gmail 검색 및 메시지 검색 지원","Calendar 및 Drive 서비스의 통합 지원","OAuth를 사용하여 인증 수행","다중 계정 관리 지원","명령줄 도구를 통한 빠른 운영 제공"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Gmail y Calendar","Configuración de OAuth","Búsqueda de correos electrónicos con comandos personalizados"," Envío de correos electrónicos con formato plano","Compatibilidad con múltiples servicios de Google"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Gmail et Calendar","Configuration OAuth","Recherche de courriels avec des commandes personnalisées","Envoi de courriels avec format plat","Compatibilité avec plusieurs services Google"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Gmail und Calendar","OAuth-Konfiguration","E-Mail-Suche mit benutzerdefinierten Befehlen","E-Mail-Versand im Plain-Format","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Google-Diensten"],"pt":["Autenticação com OAuth","Gerenciamento de e-mails com gog gmail search","Gerenciamento de calendários com gog calendar","Suporte a múltiplos serviços como Gmail, Calendar e Drive","Comandos personalizados para automação de tarefas","Integração com contas de e-mail e calendário"],"ru":["Аутентификация с помощью OAuth","Управление электронной почтой с помощью gog gmail search","Управление календарями с помощью gog calendar","Поддержка нескольких сервисов, таких как Gmail, Calendar и Drive","Пользовательские команды для автоматизации задач","Интеграция с учетными записями электронной почты и календаря"],"ar":["التحقق من الهوية باستخدام OAuth","إدارة البريد الإلكتروني باستخدام gog gmail search","إدارة التقويم باستخدام gog calendar","دعم خدمات متعددة مثل Gmail و Calendar و Drive","أوامر مخصصة لتشغيل المهام الآلية","التكامل مع حسابات البريد الإلكتروني والتقويم"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gog","gog oauth setup","gog vs openclaw","gog install guide","what is gog","gog alternative","gog market intelligence","gog trading analysis","gog setup tutorial","gog authentication"],"zh":["gog","Gmail API","Calendar API","Drive API","OAuth","命令行工具","AI エージェント","自动化","集成"],"ja":["gog","Gmail API","Calendar API","Drive API","OAuth","コマンドラインツール","AI エージェント","自動化","統合"],"ko":["gog","Gmail API","Calendar API","Drive API","OAuth","명령줄 도구","AI 에이전트","자동화","통합"],"es":["gog configuración","gog Gmail","gog Calendar","agente de inteligencia artificial","herramienta de línea de comandos","OAuth","correo electrónico","búsqueda de correo electrónico","envío de correo electrónico"],"fr":["gog configuration","gog Gmail","gog Calendar","agent IA","outil en ligne de commande","OAuth","courriel","recherche de courriel","envoi de courriel"],"de":["gog Konfiguration","gog Gmail","gog Calendar","künstlicher Intelligenz-Agent","Kommandozeilen-Tool","OAuth","E-Mail","E-Mail-Suche","E-Mail-Versand"],"pt":["gog","automação de tarefas","OAuth","gerenciamento de e-mails","gerenciamento de calendários","Gmail","Calendar","Drive","comandos personalizados","integração com contas de e-mail"],"ru":["gog","автоматизация задач","OAuth","управление электронной почтой","управление календарями","Gmail","Calendar","Drive","пользовательские команды","интеграция с учетными записями электронной почты"],"ar":["gog","تشغيل المهام الآلية","OAuth","إدارة البريد الإلكتروني","إدارة التقويم","Gmail","Calendar","Drive","أوامر مخصصة","التكامل مع حسابات البريد الإلكتروني"]}},"owner":"EthanAlgoX","repo":"MarketBot","repoPath":"EthanAlgoX/MarketBot","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T12:46:33.370Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gog","description":"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.","bodyPreview":"# gog\n\nUse `gog` for Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs. Requires OAuth setup.\n\nSetup (once)\n- `gog auth credentials /path/to/client_secret.json`\n- `gog auth add you@gmail.com --services gmail,calendar,drive,contacts,docs,sheets`\n- `gog auth list`\n\nCommon commands\n- Gmail search: `gog gmail search ''newer_than:7d'' --max 10`\n- Gmail messages search (per email, ignores threading): `gog gmail messages search \"in:inbox from:ryanair.com\" --max 20 --account you@example.com`\n- Gmail send (plain):","body":"# gog\n\nUse `gog` for Gmail/Calendar/Drive/Contacts/Sheets/Docs. Requires OAuth setup.\n\nSetup (once)\n- `gog auth credentials /path/to/client_secret.json`\n- `gog auth add you@gmail.com --services gmail,calendar,drive,contacts,docs,sheets`\n- `gog auth list`\n\nCommon commands\n- Gmail search: `gog gmail search ''newer_than:7d'' --max 10`\n- Gmail messages search (per email, ignores threading): `gog gmail messages search \"in:inbox from:ryanair.com\" --max 20 --account you@example.com`\n- Gmail send (plain): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body \"Hello\"`\n- Gmail send (multi-line): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file ./message.txt`\n- Gmail send (stdin): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file -`\n- Gmail send (HTML): `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-html \"<p>Hello</p>\"`\n- Gmail draft: `gog gmail drafts create --to a@b.com --subject \"Hi\" --body-file ./message.txt`\n- Gmail send draft: `gog gmail drafts send <draftId>`\n- Gmail reply: `gog gmail send --to a@b.com --subject \"Re: Hi\" --body \"Reply\" --reply-to-message-id <msgId>`\n- Calendar list events: `gog calendar events <calendarId> --from <iso> --to <iso>`\n- Calendar create event: `gog calendar create <calendarId> --summary \"Title\" --from <iso> --to <iso>`\n- Calendar create with color: `gog calendar create <calendarId> --summary \"Title\" --from <iso> --to <iso> --event-color 7`\n- Calendar update event: `gog calendar update <calendarId> <eventId> --summary \"New Title\" --event-color 4`\n- Calendar show colors: `gog calendar colors`\n- Drive search: `gog drive search \"query\" --max 10`\n- Contacts: `gog contacts list --max 20`\n- Sheets get: `gog sheets get <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:D10\" --json`\n- Sheets update: `gog sheets update <sheetId> \"Tab!A1:B2\" --values-json ''[[\"A\",\"B\"],[\"1\",\"2\"]]'' --input USER_ENTERED`\n- Sheets append: `gog sheets append <sheetId> \"Tab!A:C\" --values-json ''[[\"x\",\"y\",\"z\"]]'' --insert INSERT_ROWS`\n- Sheets clear: `gog sheets clear <sheetId> \"Tab!A2:Z\"`\n- Sheets metadata: `gog sheets metadata <sheetId> --json`\n- Docs export: `gog docs export <docId> --format txt --out /tmp/doc.txt`\n- Docs cat: `gog docs cat <docId>`\n\nCalendar Colors\n- Use `gog calendar colors` to see all available event colors (IDs 1-11)\n- Add colors to events with `--event-color <id>` flag\n- Event color IDs (from `gog calendar colors` output):\n  - 1: #a4bdfc\n  - 2: #7ae7bf\n  - 3: #dbadff\n  - 4: #ff887c\n  - 5: #fbd75b\n  - 6: #ffb878\n  - 7: #46d6db\n  - 8: #e1e1e1\n  - 9: #5484ed\n  - 10: #51b749\n  - 11: #dc2127\n\nEmail Formatting\n- Prefer plain text. Use `--body-file` for multi-paragraph messages (or `--body-file -` for stdin).\n- Same `--body-file` pattern works for drafts and replies.\n- `--body` does not unescape `\\n`. If you need inline newlines, use a heredoc or `$''Line 1\\n\\nLine 2''`.\n- Use `--body-html` only when you need rich formatting.\n- HTML tags: `<p>` for paragraphs, `<br>` for line breaks, `<strong>` for bold, `<em>` for italic, `<a href=\"url\">` for links, `<ul>`/`<li>` for lists.\n- Example (plain text via stdin):\n  ```bash\n  gog gmail send --to recipient@example.com \\\n    --subject \"Meeting Follow-up\" \\\n    --body-file - <<''EOF''\n  Hi Name,\n\n  Thanks for meeting today. Next steps:\n  - Item one\n  - Item two\n\n  Best regards,\n  Your Name\n  EOF\n  ```\n- Example (HTML list):\n  ```bash\n  gog gmail send --to recipient@example.com \\\n    --subject \"Meeting Follow-up\" \\\n    --body-html \"<p>Hi Name,</p><p>Thanks for meeting today. Here are the next steps:</p><ul><li>Item one</li><li>Item two</li></ul><p>Best regards,<br>Your Name</p>\"\n  ```\n\nNotes\n- Set `GOG_ACCOUNT=you@gmail.com` to avoid repeating `--account`.\n- For scripting, prefer `--json` plus `--no-input`.\n- Sheets values can be passed via `--values-json` (recommended) or as inline rows.\n- Docs supports export/cat/copy. In-place edits require a Docs API client (not in gog).\n- Confirm before sending mail or creating events.\n- `gog gmail search` returns one row per thread; use `gog gmail messages search` when you need every individual email returned separately.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T12:50:42.538Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Finance Agents requiring market intelligence and trading analysis capabilities through Gmail and Google services integration.","zh":"适合需要市场智能和交易分析能力的金融代理，通过Gmail和Google服务集成。","ja":"市場インテリジェンスとトレーディング分析の機能を必要とする金融エージェントに適しています。GmailおよびGoogleサービスとの統合を通じて。","ko":"시장 지능과 거래 분석 기능이 필요한 금융 에이전트에게 적합합니다. Gmail 및 Google 서비스 통합을 통해 제공됩니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Finanzas que requieren inteligencia de mercado y capacidades de análisis de trading a través de la integración de Gmail y servicios de Google.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de finance nécessitant une intelligence de marché et des capacités d''analyse de trading via l''intégration de Gmail et des services Google.","de":"Ideal für Finanzagenten, die Marktintelligenz und Trading-Analysefunktionen über die Integration von Gmail und Google-Diensten benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Finanças que exigem inteligência de mercado e capacidades de análise de negociação através da integração com Gmail e serviços do Google.","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых агентов, требующих рыночной разведки и возможностей торгового анализа через интеграцию с Gmail и сервисами Google.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الماليين الذين يتطلبون استخبارات السوق وقدرات التحليل التجاري من خلال التكامل مع Gmail وخدمات Google."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate Gmail searches, send emails, and interact with Google Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs using OAuth setup and OpenCLAW, providing seamless access to financial data and market insights.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化Gmail搜索、发送电子邮件、与Google日历、Drive、联系人、Sheets和Docs交互的能力，使用OAuth设置和OpenCLAW，提供对金融数据和市场洞察的无缝访问。","ja":"OAuth設定とOpenCLAWを使用して、Gmailの検索の自動化、メールの送信、Google Calendar、Drive、Contacts、Sheets、Docsとの相互作用を可能にし、金融データと市場の洞察への無制限アクセスを提供します。","ko":"OAuth 설정과 OpenCLAW를 사용하여 Gmail 검색 자동화, 이메일 발송, Google 캘린더, 드라이브, 연락처, 시트, 문서와의 상호 작용을 가능하게 하며, 금융 데이터와 시장 정보에 대한 무제한 액세스를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar búsquedas de Gmail, enviar correos electrónicos e interactuar con Google Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets y Docs utilizando la configuración de OAuth y OpenCLAW, proporcionando un acceso sin problemas a datos financieros y perspectivas del mercado.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les recherches Gmail, d''envoyer des e-mails et d''interagir avec Google Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets et Docs en utilisant la configuration OAuth et OpenCLAW, offrant un accès sans problème aux données financières et aux perspectives du marché.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Gmail-Suchen zu automatisieren, E-Mails zu senden und mit Google Calendar, Drive, Kontakte, Sheets und Docs zu interagieren, indem sie die OAuth-Konfiguration und OpenCLAW verwenden, um einen nahtlosen Zugriff auf Finanzdaten und Markteinblicke zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar pesquisas no Gmail, enviar e-mails e interagir com Google Calendar, Drive, Contatos, Sheets e Docs usando configuração OAuth e OpenCLAW, fornecendo acesso sem interrupções a dados financeiros e informações de mercado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать поиск в Gmail, отправлять электронные письма и взаимодействовать с Google Calendar, Drive, Контакты, Sheets и Docs с помощью настройки OAuth и OpenCLAW, обеспечивая бесперебойный доступ к финансовым данным и рыночным данным.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير عمليات بحث في Gmail، وإرسال البريد الإلكتروني والتفاعل مع تقويم Google، وド라이ブ، والاتصال، والصحف، والوثائق باستخدام إعداد OAuth و OpenCLAW، وتوفير الوصول دون انقطاع إلى البيانات المالية ومعلومات السوق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Gmail searches for financial news and updates","Sending customized financial reports via Gmail","Integrating Google Sheets for real-time market data analysis"],"zh":["自动化Gmail搜索以获取金融新闻和更新","通过Gmail发送自定义的金融报告","将Google Sheets集成到实时市场数据分析中"],"ja":["金融ニュースと更新を取得するためのGmail検索の自動化","Gmail経由でカスタマイズされた金融報告書を送信する","リアルタイムの市場データ分析のためにGoogle Sheetsを統合する"],"ko":["금융 뉴스 및 업데이트 검색을 위해 Gmail 검색 자동화","Gmail을 통해 맞춤형 금융 보고서를 보내는 것","실시간 시장 데이터 분석을 위해 Google 시트 통합"],"es":["Automatizar búsquedas de Gmail para noticias y actualizaciones financieras","Enviar informes financieros personalizados a través de Gmail","Integrar Google Sheets para análisis de datos de mercado en tiempo real"],"fr":["Automatiser les recherches Gmail pour les actualités et mises à jour financières","Envoyer des rapports financiers personnalisés via Gmail","Intégrer Google Sheets pour l''analyse de données de marché en temps réel"],"de":["Automatisierung von Gmail-Suchen für Finanznachrichten und -updates","Senden von maßgeschneiderten Finanzberichten über Gmail","Integration von Google Sheets für Echtzeit-Marktdatenanalyse"],"pt":["Automatizar pesquisas no Gmail para notícias e atualizações financeiras","Enviar relatórios financeiros personalizados via Gmail","Integrar Google Sheets para análise de dados de mercado em tempo real"],"ru":["Автоматизировать поиск в Gmail для финансовых новостей и обновлений","Отправлять индивидуальные финансовые отчеты через Gmail","Интегрировать Google Sheets для анализа рыночных данных в реальном времени"],"ar":["توفير عمليات بحث في Gmail لأخبار وتحديثات مالية","إرسال تقارير مالية مخصصة عبر Gmail","دمج جداول Google لتحليل بيانات السوق في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires OAuth setup","Needs client_secret.json for authentication","Limited to Gmail and Google services"],"zh":["需要OAuth设置","需要client_secret.json进行身份验证","仅限Gmail和Google服务"],"ja":["OAuth設定が必要","認証にclient_secret.jsonが必要","GmailとGoogleサービスのみに限定"],"ko":["OAuth 설정이 필요합니다.","인증을 위해 client_secret.json 필요","Gmail 및 Google 서비스로만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de OAuth","Necesita client_secret.json para la autenticación","Limitado a Gmail y servicios de Google"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration OAuth","Nécessite client_secret.json pour l''authentification","Limité à Gmail et aux services Google"],"de":["Benötigt OAuth-Konfiguration","Benötigt client_secret.json für die Authentifizierung","Begrenzt auf Gmail und Google-Dienste"],"pt":["Exige configuração OAuth","Necessita de client_secret.json para autenticação","Limitado a Gmail e serviços do Google"],"ru":["Требует настройки OAuth","Требует client_secret.json для аутентификации","Ограничен только Gmail и сервисами Google"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد OAuth","يتطلب client_secret.json للتأشير","محدود بـ Gmail وخدمات Google"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4882b9f7160c6a8b3692e1b001a1df9aa0835908cac934bed3f33361f73fbfe6","qualityScore":42}');
