ormats de graphiques","Intégration avec des outils de développement de matériel"],"de":["Konvertierung von SystemVerilog in Grafiken","Analyse von Hardware-Entwürfen","Visualisierung von Datenstrukturen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Grafikformaten","Integration mit Hardware-Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Conversão de SystemVerilog em grafos","Análise de sistemas complexos","Desenvolvimento de sistemas mais eficientes","Integração com outras ferramentas de IA","Suporte a linguagens de programação variadas"],"ru":["Преобразование SystemVerilog в графы","Анализ сложных систем","Разработка более эффективных систем","Интеграция с другими инструментами ИИ","Поддержка различных языков программирования"],"ar":["تحويل SystemVerilog إلى رسوم بيانية","تحليل الأنظمة المعقدة","تطوير أنظمة أكثر كفاءة","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","دعم لغات برمجة متنوعة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["c910-autofix","SystemVerilog","图转换","AI工具","设计流程","开发效率","如何使用c910-autofix","c910-autofix教程"],"ja":["c910-autofix","SystemVerilog","グラフへの変換","AIエージェント","設計プロセス","開発効率","c910-autofixの使い方","c910-autofixチュートリアル"],"ko":["c910-autofix","SystemVerilog","그래프로의 변환","AI 에이전트","설계 프로세스","개발 효율","c910-autofix 사용 방법","c910-autofix 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","c910-autofix tutorial","SystemVerilog a gráficos","diseño de hardware con AI","c910-autofix vs otras herramientas","instalación de c910-autofix","guía de configuración de c910-autofix"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour développeurs","tutoriel c910-autofix","SystemVerilog en graphiques","conception de matériel avec IA","c910-autofix vs autres outils","installation de c910-autofix","guide de configuration de c910-autofix"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","c910-autofix-Tutorial","SystemVerilog in Grafiken","Hardware-Entwurf mit KI","c910-autofix im Vergleich zu anderen Tools","Installation von c910-autofix","Konfigurationsanleitung für c910-autofix"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","c910-autofix","systemverilog","conversão de grafos","análise de sistemas","desenvolvimento de sistemas","ia para desenvolvedores","ferramentas de desenvolvimento de ia","c910-autofix vs outras ferramentas"],"ru":["инструменты ии","c910-autofix","systemverilog","преобразование графов","анализ систем","разработка систем","ии для разработчиков","инструменты разработки ии","c910-autofix vs другие инструменты"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","c910-autofix","systemverilog","تحويل الرسوم البيانية","تحليل الأنظمة","تطوير الأنظمة","الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","أدوات تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","c910-autofix مقابل أدوات أخرى"]}},"owner":"Wolf-Tungsten","repo":"wolf-sv-parser","repoPath":"Wolf-Tungsten/wolf-sv-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T08:25:24.744Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"c910-autofix","description":"Auto-discover a C910 simulation failure by running make run_c910_test, create a minimal bugcase, reproduce the error with wolf-sv-parser, attempt a fix in wolf-sv-parser, verify the fix, and write a docs/c910 review report. Use for C910 bugcase creation + fix workflows.","bodyPreview":"# C910 Bugcase + Fix Workflow\n\nUse this skill when the user wants an end-to-end flow: detect a C910 simulation error, generate a minimal repro case, fix wolf-sv-parser, and document the fix for human review.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Optional `CASE_ID`: if the user requests a specific case number; otherwise choose the next available `case_XXX`.\n- Optional `USER_LOG`: a user-provided log file path or pasted snippet. Use it to seed repro if provided.\n- Optional `DUT_TOP`: a user-provided module name to target","body":"# C910 Bugcase + Fix Workflow\n\nUse this skill when the user wants an end-to-end flow: detect a C910 simulation error, generate a minimal repro case, fix wolf-sv-parser, and document the fix for human review.\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Optional `CASE_ID`: if the user requests a specific case number; otherwise choose the next available `case_XXX`.\n- Optional `USER_LOG`: a user-provided log file path or pasted snippet. Use it to seed repro if provided.\n- Optional `DUT_TOP`: a user-provided module name to target (e.g., `axi_slave128`).\n- Optional `SIGNALS`: a user-provided comma-separated signal list (e.g., `mem_dout, mem_addr`) to guide module selection.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Entry paths:\n   - If the user provides `USER_LOG`, read it first and extract warnings/errors (focus on error/critical lines, then warnings). Use these messages to identify likely RTL files/modules and the failure signature to reproduce.\n   - If no `USER_LOG` is provided or it lacks actionable error context, run `make run_c910_test` from repo root and capture stdout/stderr to a log file (e.g. `build/artifacts/c910_run.log`). Use this log path for all subsequent steps.\n2. Read the chosen log (user-provided or freshly generated). Extract the error snippet and locate the referenced RTL file/module.\n   - If `DUT_TOP` is provided, prioritize that module for the repro even if the log\n     mentions other modules.\n   - If `SIGNALS` is provided, use it to identify candidate modules and signal\n     ownership before choosing the final `DUT_TOP`.\n     - Example: `rg -n \"signal_name\" tests/data/openc910/C910_RTL_FACTORY`\n     - After collecting matches, group by file/module and pick the module that\n       contains the most requested signals.\n     - If multiple modules tie, prefer the one that contains the DUT context\n       from the log or the module directly referenced by a `module <name>` block.\n   - Prefer the RTL file path and module name mentioned in the error or warning.\n3. Determine `DUT_TOP` and minimal RTL sources.\n   - Use `rg -n \"module <DUT_TOP>\"` in `tests/data/openc910/C910_RTL_FACTORY` to find the module file.\n   - Keep `filelist.f` minimal; prefer existing RTL paths. Add `stub_modules.v` only when needed.\n4. Create a new case directory `tests/data/openc910/bug_cases/case_XXX`.\n   - Choose the next available index unless `CASE_ID` is provided.\n5. Create files (no `tb_case_xxx.v`; test the module directly):\n   - `filelist.f` (RTL only)\n   - `tb_case_xxx.cpp` (drives DUT directly)\n   - `Makefile`\n   - `bug_report.md`\n   - `coverage_check.py`\n   - optional `stub_modules.v`\n   Use templates from `assets/` and replace placeholders:\n   - `CASE_ID` -> `001` (or chosen index)\n   - `DUT_TOP` -> module name\n   - `__DUT_TOP__` -> module name (for `V<top>` symbols)\n6. TB requirements:\n   - Include `V<DUT_TOP>.h`, implement clock/reset, deterministic stimulus, and at least one correctness check.\n   - Ensure the stimulus exercises enough logic so that coverage is close to 90% when running `run_c910_bug_case_ref`.\n   - TB validates module behavior; treat the original ref RTL as the gold standard for expected behavior.\n   - TB is driven by the ref flow; do not modify TB to accommodate wolf output or wolf-only failures.\n   - When `VM_COVERAGE` is enabled, write coverage to `VERILATOR_COV_FILE`.\n7. Makefile requirements:\n   - Targets: `run`, `run_c910_bug_case_ref`, `run_c910_bug_case`, `clean`.\n   - `run` uses `--top $(DUT_TOP)` to emit `wolf_emit.sv`.\n   - `run_c910_bug_case_ref` runs RTL directly; `run_c910_bug_case` runs `wolf_emit.sv`.\n   - Coverage enabled with `COVERAGE=1`; enforce `COV_MIN` (default 90%) for the ref run only.\n   - For the wolf run, report coverage but do not fail the run (e.g. use `COV_MIN=0` when invoking it).\n   - Outputs under `build/c910_bug_case/case_xxx/{rtl,wolf}` only.\n8. Fill `bug_report.md` with the error summary, repro commands, expected vs actual, and minimization notes (include the log path and a snippet).\n9. Validate behavior:\n   - `make -C tests/data/openc910/bug_cases/case_XXX run_c910_bug_case_ref` must complete without errors and coverage should be close to 90% (adjust TB stimulus to raise coverage; keep `COV_MIN` at 90 unless absolutely necessary).\n   - `make -C tests/data/openc910/bug_cases/case_XXX run_c910_bug_case` must reproduce the same class of error message seen in the log (e.g., the same “Value already has a defining operation” failure). If it does not, refine the filelist; do not change TB for wolf-only behavior.\n10. Diagnose the root cause in `wolf-sv-parser`:\n    - Locate the failing code path (parser, elaborator, or emitter) using the error signature and minimal repro case.\n    - Prefer the smallest fix that preserves existing behavior; update or add tests if the fix changes expected output.\n11. Apply the fix:\n    - Edit `src/` and/or `include/` as needed.\n    - Rebuild with `cmake --build build -j$(nproc)` (configure with `cmake -S . -B build` if needed).\n12. Verify the fix:\n    - Re-run `make -C tests/data/openc910/bug_cases/case_XXX run_c910_bug_case` and confirm the previous error no longer reproduces (report coverage only; do not enforce `COV_MIN`).\n    - Run `ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure` if the fix affects shared logic.\n13. Write a fix report for human review under `docs/c910/` (e.g., `docs/c910/case_XXX_fix_report.md`):\n    - Problem summary and original failure signature (include log path and a short snippet).\n    - Minimal repro details (case path, DUT top, coverage status).\n    - Root cause analysis in `wolf-sv-parser`.\n    - Fix details (files changed, rationale, risks).\n    - Validation results (commands and outcomes).\n    - Open questions or follow-ups.\n14. Stop after report creation. Do not assume the fix is accepted; the human reviewer decides.\n\n## References\n\n- `docs/c910/openc910调试方案.md`\n\n## Templates\n\n- `assets/Makefile.template`\n- `assets/tb_case_xxx.cpp.template`\n- `assets/bug_report.md.template`\n- `assets/coverage_check.py`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T10:34:56.347Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing SystemVerilog to graph conversion capabilities with advanced error detection and fix workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要将SystemVerilog转换为图形的Debugging Agents，具有高级错误检测和修复工作流程的功能。","ja":"SystemVerilogをグラフへの変換機能を必要とするデバッグエージェントに最適です。高度なエラーディテクションと修復ワークフローを備えています。","ko":"SystemVerilog를 그래프로 변환하는 기능이 필요한 디버깅 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 고급 오류 감지 및 수정 워크플로를 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan capacidades de conversión de SystemVerilog a gráficos con flujos de trabajo de detección y corrección de errores avanzados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage nécessitant des capacités de conversion de SystemVerilog en graphique avec des flux de travail de détection et de correction d''erreurs avancés.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die SystemVerilog-zu-Graph-Konvertierungsfunktionen mit erweiterten Fehlererkennungs- und Korrekturworkflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de depuração que necessitam de capacidades de conversão de SystemVerilog para gráfico com detecção de erros avançada e fluxos de trabalho de correção.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов отладки, требующих возможностей преобразования SystemVerilog в граф с расширенным обнаружением ошибок и рабочими процессами исправления.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تصحيح الأخطاء الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات تحويل SystemVerilog إلى مخطط مع كشف أخطاء متقدم وعمليات عمل تصحيح."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate C910 simulation error detection, generate minimal repro cases, and fix wolf-sv-parser issues, leveraging SystemVerilog parsing and graph conversion, while documenting fixes for human review using protocols like log file analysis and module targeting.","zh":"赋予代理人自动化C910模拟错误检测、生成最小重现案例和修复wolf-sv-parser问题的能力，利用SystemVerilog解析和图形转换，同时使用日志文件分析和模块定位等协议记录修复过程供人工审查。","ja":"エージェントにC910シミュレーションエラーディテクションの自動化、最小の再現ケースの生成、wolf-sv-parserの問題の修復を可能にします。SystemVerilogの解析とグラフへの変換を活用し、ログファイル分析やモジュールターゲティングなどのプロトコルを使用して修復過程を人間のレビューのために文書化します。","ko":"에이전트가 C910 시뮬레이션 오류 감지, 최소 재현 사례 생성 및 wolf-sv-parser 이슈 수정을 자동화하도록 합니다. SystemVerilog 파싱 및 그래프 변환을 활용하며, 로그 파일 분석 및 모듈 타겟팅과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 수정 과정을 인간의 검토를 위해 문서화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la detección de errores de simulación C910, generar casos de reproducción mínimos y solucionar problemas de wolf-sv-parser, aprovechando el análisis y la conversión de SystemVerilog, mientras documenta las soluciones para la revisión humana utilizando protocolos como el análisis de archivos de registro y la orientación de módulos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la détection d''erreurs de simulation C910, de générer des cas de reproduction minimaux et de résoudre les problèmes de wolf-sv-parser, en exploitant l''analyse et la conversion de SystemVerilog, tout en documentant les corrections pour la révision humaine en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''analyse de fichiers journaux et la ciblage de modules.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die C910-Simulationsfehlererkennung zu automatisieren, minimale Reproduktionsfälle zu generieren und wolf-sv-parser-Probleme zu beheben, indem es die SystemVerilog-Analyse und -Konvertierung nutzt, während es die Korrekturen für die menschliche Überprüfung unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Logdateianalyse und Modulzielsetzung dokumentiert.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a detecção de erros de simulação C910, gerar casos de reprodução mínimos e corrigir problemas do wolf-sv-parser, aproveitando a análise e conversão de SystemVerilog, enquanto documenta as correções para revisão humana usando protocolos como análise de arquivos de log e direcionamento de módulos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать обнаружение ошибок симуляции C910, генерировать минимальные репро-кейсы и исправлять проблемы с wolf-sv-parser, используя анализ и преобразование SystemVerilog, а также документировать исправления для рассмотрения человеком с помощью протоколов, таких как анализ файлов журнала и нацеливание на модули.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على توفير автоматизации كشف الأخطاء في محاكاة C910، وتوليد حالات إعادة إنتاج قليلة، وتصحيح مشاكل wolf-sv-parser، مستفيداً من تحليل SystemVerilog والتحويل، مع توثيق التصحيحات لمراجعة الإنسان باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تحليل ملفات السجل والاستهداف الوحدوي."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating C910 bug case detection and fix workflows","Generating minimal repro cases for SystemVerilog simulation errors","Debugging wolf-sv-parser issues with targeted module analysis"],"zh":["自动化C910 버그 케이스 감지 및 수정 워크플로우","SystemVerilog 시뮬레이션 오류에 대한 최소 재현 사례 생성","대상 모듈 분석을 통한 wolf-sv-parser 이슈 디버깅"],"ja":["C910バグケースの検出と修復ワークフローの自動化","SystemVerilogシミュレーションエラーの最小の再現ケースの生成","wolf-sv-parserの問題のデバッグを対象モジュール分析で実行"],"ko":["C910 버그 케이스 감지 및 수정 워크플로우 자동화","SystemVerilog 시뮬레이션 오류에 대한 최소 재현 사례 생성","대상 모듈 분석을 통한 wolf-sv-parser 이슈 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la detección y corrección de errores de caso de bug C910","Generar casos de reproducción mínimos para errores de simulación de SystemVerilog","Depurar problemas de wolf-sv-parser con análisis de módulos dirigidos"],"fr":["Automatiser la détection et la correction des erreurs de cas de bogue C910","Générer des cas de reproduction minimaux pour les erreurs de simulation de SystemVerilog","Déboguer les problèmes de wolf-sv-parser avec une analyse de modules ciblés"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erkennung und Korrektur von C910- Bug-Fehlern","Generieren minimaler Reproduktionsfälle für SystemVerilog-Simulationsfehler","Beheben von wolf-sv-parser-Problemen mit gezielten Modulanalysen"],"pt":["Automatizar a detecção de erros de caso de bug C910 e fluxos de trabalho de correção","Gerar casos de reprodução mínimos para erros de simulação SystemVerilog","Depurar problemas do wolf-sv-parser com análise de módulo direcionada"],"ru":["Автоматизировать обнаружение ошибок в случае бага C910 и рабочие процессы исправления","Генерировать минимальные репро-кейсы для ошибок симуляции SystemVerilog","Отлаживать проблемы с wolf-sv-parser с помощью нацеливания на модуль"],"ar":["توفير أتمتة كشف أخطاء حالة خطأ C910 وعمليات العمل التصحيحية","توليد حالات إعادة إنتاج قليلة لأخطاء محاكاة SystemVerilog","تصحيح أخطاء wolf-sv-parser باستخدام تحليل الوحدة المستهدفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SystemVerilog parser support","Limited to C910 simulation error detection and fix workflows","Optional dependencies on user-provided log files and module names"],"zh":["需要SystemVerilog解析器支持","仅限C910模拟错误检测和修复工作流程","可选依赖于用户提供的日志文件和模块名称"],"ja":["SystemVerilogパーサーのサポートが必要","C910シミュレーションエラーディテクションと修復ワークフローに限定","ユーザー提供のログファイルとモジュール名に依存するオプションの依存関係"],"ko":["SystemVerilog 파서 지원이 필요합니다.","C910 시뮬레이션 오류 감지 및 수정 워크플로우에만 제한됩니다.","사용자 제공 로그 파일 및 모듈 이름에 대한 선택적 종속성"],"es":["Requiere soporte de analizador de SystemVerilog","Limitado a la detección y corrección de errores de simulación C910","Dependencias opcionales de archivos de registro y nombres de módulos proporcionados por el usuario"],"fr":["Nécessite une prise en charge de l''analyseur SystemVerilog","Limité à la détection et la correction des erreurs de simulation C910","Dépendances optionnelles de fichiers journaux et de noms de modules fournis par l''utilisateur"],"de":["Benötigt SystemVerilog-Parser-Unterstützung","Begrenzt auf die Erkennung und Korrektur von C910-Simulationsfehlern","Optionale Abhängigkeiten von Benutzer bereitgestellten Logdateien und Modulnamen"],"pt":["Requer suporte ao parser SystemVerilog","Limitado à detecção de erros de simulação C910 e fluxos de trabalho de correção","Dependências opcionais de arquivos de log e nomes de módulos fornecidos pelo usuário"],"ru":["Требует поддержки парсера SystemVerilog","Ограничен обнаружением ошибок симуляции C910 и рабочими процессами исправления","Опциональные зависимости от файлов журнала и имен модулей, предоставляемых пользователем"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم المُحلل SystemVerilog","محدود بكشف أخطاء محاكاة C910 وعمليات العمل التصحيحية","اعتماديات اختيارية على ملفات السجل وأسماء الوحدات المقدمة من قبل المستخدم"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e8299ad7f8c0c73dfaabda7132de4a4bc0e4804632f493c2a5355ad3dff85a92","qualityScore":42}');
