auf GitHub","pt":"O GitHub Search é uma ferramenta de busca que permite aos desenvolvedores encontrar repositórios, código e issues no GitHub","ru":"GitHub Search - это инструмент поиска, который позволяет разработчикам найти репозитории, код и issues на GitHub","ar":"بحث GitHub هو أداة بحث تمكن المطورين من العثور على المستودعات والكود والقضايا على منصة GitHub"},"features":{"en":["Searches repositories using the gh search repos command","Supports code search with gh search code","Enables issue search using gh search issues","Allows pull request search with gh search prs","Utilizes Direct API Search for complex queries","Automatically URL-encodes queries for precise results"],"zh":["快速命令：gh search repos、gh search code、gh search issues、gh search prs","直接 API 搜索：gh api \"search/repository\"","支持 URL 编码查询","限制搜索结果：--limit 30","支持仓库、代码、问题、PR 搜索"],"ja":["クイックコマンド：gh search repos、gh search code、gh search issues、gh search prs","直接 API 検索：gh api \"search/repository\"","URL エンコードクエリをサポート","検索結果の制限：--limit 30","リポジトリ、コード、問題、PR 検索をサポート"],"ko":["빠른 명령: gh search repos, gh search code, gh search issues, gh search prs","직접 API 검색: gh api \"search/repository\"","URL 인코딩 쿼리를 지원","검색 결과 제한: --limit 30","저장소, 코드, 문제, PR 검색을 지원"],"es":["Búsqueda de repositorios con `gh search repos`","Búsqueda de código con `gh search code`","Búsqueda de problemas con `gh search issues`","Búsqueda de solicitudes de extracción con `gh search prs`","Compatibilidad con búsqueda directa de API para resultados exactos"],"fr":["Recherche de référentiels avec `gh search repos`","Recherche de code avec `gh search code`","Recherche de problèmes avec `gh search issues`","Recherche de demandes de tirage avec `gh search prs`","Prise en charge de la recherche d''API directe pour des résultats exacts"],"de":["Suche nach Repositorys mit `gh search repos`","Suche nach Code mit `gh search code`","Suche nach Problemen mit `gh search issues`","Suche nach Pull-Requests mit `gh search prs`","Unterstützung für direkte API-Suche für exakte Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Busca em repositórios com `gh search repos`","Busca em código com `gh search code`","Busca em issues com `gh search issues`","Busca em PRs com `gh search prs`","Suporte a consultas complexas com API de busca direta"],"ru":["Поиск репозиториев с помощью `gh search repos`","Поиск кода с помощью `gh search code`","Поиск issues с помощью `gh search issues`","Поиск PRs с помощью `gh search prs`","Поддержка сложных запросов с помощью прямого API поиска"],"ar":["بحث المستودعات باستخدام `gh search repos`","بحث الكود باستخدام `gh search code`","بحث القضايا باستخدام `gh search issues`","بحث الطلبات باستخدام `gh search prs`","دعم الاستفسارات المعقدة مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للبحث المباشر"]},"keywords":{"en":["github-search setup guide","how to use github-search","github-search alternative","github-search vs git search","github-search install","what is github-search","github-search api","github-search commands","github-search tutorial"],"zh":["GitHub 搜索工具","GitHub 搜索命令","GitHub API 搜索","仓库搜索","代码搜索","问题搜索","PR 搜索","命令行工具"],"ja":["GitHub 検索ツール","GitHub 検索コマンド","GitHub API 検索","リポジトリ検索","コード検索","問題検索","PR 検索","コマンドラインツール"],"ko":["GitHub 검색 에이전트","GitHub 검색 명령","GitHub API 검색","저장소 검색","코드 검색","문제 검색","PR 검색","명령줄 도구"],"es":["github-search","búsqueda en github","herramientas de desarrollo","línea de comandos","API de github","buscar repositorios","buscar código","buscar problemas"],"fr":["github-search","recherche sur github","outils de développement","ligne de commande","API github","rechercher des référentiels","rechercher du code","rechercher des problèmes"],"de":["github-search","suche auf github","entwicklertools","kommandozeile","github-api","repositorys suchen","code suchen","probleme suchen"],"pt":["github search","busca em repositórios","busca em código","busca em issues","busca em PRs","API de busca direta","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","otimização de busca"],"ru":["github search","поиск репозиториев","поиск кода","поиск issues","поиск PRs","прямой API поиска","инструменты разработки","оптимизация поиска"],"ar":["بحث github","بحث المستودعات","بحث الكود","بحث القضايا","بحث الطلبات","واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للبحث المباشر","أدوات التطوير","تحسين البحث"]}},"owner":"brixtonpham","repo":"claude-setup","repoPath":"brixtonpham/claude-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T06:23:00.159Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-search","description":"Search GitHub for repos, code, and usage examples using gh CLI. Capabilities: repo discovery, code search, finding library usage patterns, issue/PR search. Actions: search, find, discover repos/code/examples. Keywords: gh, github, search repos, search code, find examples, how to use library, stars, language filter. Use when: finding repositories, searching code patterns, discovering how libraries are used, exploring open source.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Search\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Goal | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Search repos | `gh search repos \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search code | `gh search code \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search issues | `gh search issues \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search PRs | `gh search prs \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n\n## Direct API Search (Web-Exact Results)\n\nFor complex queries where `gh search repos` gives different results than web:\n\n```bash\n# Template - URL-encodes query automatically\ngh api \"search/reposito","body":"# GitHub Search\n\n## Quick Commands\n\n| Goal | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Search repos | `gh search repos \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search code | `gh search code \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search issues | `gh search issues \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n| Search PRs | `gh search prs \"<query>\" --limit 30` |\n\n## Direct API Search (Web-Exact Results)\n\nFor complex queries where `gh search repos` gives different results than web:\n\n```bash\n# Template - URL-encodes query automatically\ngh api \"search/repositories?q=$(printf ''%s'' ''YOUR_QUERY_HERE'' | jq -sRr @uri)&sort=updated&per_page=30\" --jq ''.items[].full_name''\n```\n\n**Example - Multi-language with exclusions:**\n```bash\ngh api \"search/repositories?q=$(printf ''%s'' ''stars:>500 language:rust language:go language:TypeScript language:javascript -topic:ethereum -topic:cryptocurrency -topic:blockchain -topic:bitcoin -topic:web3'' | jq -sRr @uri)&sort=updated&per_page=10\" --jq ''.items[].full_name''\n```\n\n**Why use this?**\n- `gh search repos` is a convenience wrapper with its own query parsing\n- `gh api search/repositories` hits the raw API, matching web behavior exactly\n- Required when combining: multiple languages + topic exclusions + star filters\n\n**Common jq extractions:**\n| Output | jq filter |\n|--------|-----------|\n| Names only | `--jq ''.items[].name''` |\n| Full names | `--jq ''.items[].full_name''` |\n| With stars | `--jq ''.items[] \\| \"\\(.full_name) ⭐\\(.stargazers_count)\"''` |\n| URLs | `--jq ''.items[].html_url''` |\n| Full JSON | (omit --jq) |\n\n## Patterns\n\n### Finding Repositories\n\n**When you see:** User wants to find projects/repos by criteria\n**Use:** `gh search repos`\n\n```bash\n# Basic search with stars\ngh search repos \"stars:>500 language:rust\" --sort=stars --limit=50\n\n# Multiple languages (OR logic)\ngh search repos \"language:rust language:go language:typescript\"\n\n# Exclude topics\ngh search repos \"stars:>1000 -topic:cryptocurrency -topic:blockchain\"\n\n# By topic\ngh search repos \"topic:cli topic:terminal stars:>100\"\n\n# Recently updated\ngh search repos \"language:python pushed:>2024-01-01\"\n```\n\n**Output formats:**\n```bash\n--json name,url,description,stargazersCount  # JSON output\n--web                                         # Open in browser\n```\n\n### Finding Code Examples\n\n**When you see:** User wants to know how to use a library\n**Use:** `gh search code`\n\n```bash\n# Find usage patterns\ngh search code \"from zod import\" --limit=20\ngh search code \"import { z } from ''zod''\" --limit=20\n\n# In specific file types\ngh search code \"useQuery\" extension:tsx --limit=30\n\n# In specific paths\ngh search code \"tanstack/query\" path:src/ extension:ts\n\n# Exact phrase\ngh search code ''\"createTRPCRouter\"'' extension:ts\n```\n\n**Pro tip:** Combine with repo filter for focused results:\n```bash\ngh search code \"pattern\" repo:owner/repo\n```\n\n### Finding Issues/Discussions\n\n**When you see:** User looking for bug reports, feature requests, or discussions\n**Use:** `gh search issues` or `gh search prs`\n\n```bash\n# Open issues with label\ngh search issues \"is:open label:bug repo:facebook/react\"\n\n# PRs by author\ngh search prs \"author:username is:merged\"\n\n# Issues mentioning error\ngh search issues ''\"connection refused\" language:go''\n```\n\n## Query Qualifiers Reference\n\n### Repo Search\n| Qualifier | Example | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `stars:` | `stars:>1000`, `stars:100..500` | Star count |\n| `forks:` | `forks:>100` | Fork count |\n| `language:` | `language:rust` | Primary language |\n| `topic:` | `topic:cli` | Repository topic |\n| `-topic:` | `-topic:blockchain` | Exclude topic |\n| `pushed:` | `pushed:>2024-01-01` | Last push date |\n| `created:` | `created:>2023-01-01` | Creation date |\n| `license:` | `license:mit` | License type |\n| `archived:` | `archived:false` | Archive status |\n| `is:` | `is:public`, `is:private` | Visibility |\n\n### Code Search\n| Qualifier | Example | Description |\n|-----------|---------|-------------|\n| `extension:` | `extension:ts` | File extension |\n| `path:` | `path:src/` | File path |\n| `repo:` | `repo:owner/name` | Specific repo |\n| `language:` | `language:javascript` | Code language |\n| `filename:` | `filename:package.json` | File name |\n\n### Common Flags\n| Flag | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `--limit N` | Number of results (max 1000) |\n| `--sort X` | Sort by: stars, forks, updated, best-match |\n| `--order X` | asc or desc |\n| `--json FIELDS` | JSON output with specific fields |\n| `--web` | Open results in browser |\n\n## Common Use Cases\n\n### \"Find popular X repos\"\n```bash\ngh search repos \"language:X stars:>500\" --sort=stars --limit=50\n```\n\n### \"How do people use library Y\"\n```bash\ngh search code \"import Y\" extension:ts --limit=30\ngh search code \"from Y import\" extension:py --limit=30\n```\n\n### \"Find repos like Z but exclude crypto\"\n```bash\ngh search repos \"topic:Z -topic:cryptocurrency -topic:blockchain -topic:web3\"\n```\n\n### \"Find recent active projects\"\n```bash\ngh search repos \"language:go pushed:>2024-06-01 stars:>100\" --sort=updated\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Quote the query** when it contains special chars: `gh search repos \"stars:>500\"`\n2. **Multiple languages = OR**: `language:rust language:go` matches either\n3. **Use `--json`** for scripting: `--json name,url,stargazersCount`\n4. **Date ranges**: `pushed:2024-01-01..2024-06-01`\n5. **Numeric ranges**: `stars:100..500`\n6. **Use `gh api` for complex queries**: When `gh search repos` gives unexpected results, use `gh api search/repositories?q=...` for exact web parity\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T07:23:42.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing precise GitHub repository and code search capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要精确 GitHub 仓库和代码搜索功能的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリとコードの検索機能が必要な開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"정확한 GitHub 저장소 및 코드 검색 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de búsqueda precisas de repositorios y código de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de recherche précises de référentiels et de code GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die präzise GitHub-Repository- und Code-Suchfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de capacidades de pesquisa de repositório e código do GitHub precisas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуются точные возможности поиска репозиториев и кода GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات البحث الدقيق لمستودع GitHub والكود."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently search GitHub repositories, code, issues, and PRs using specific commands like `gh search repos` and Direct API Search, providing precise results and leveraging GitHub''s API for complex queries.","zh":"使代理能够使用诸如 `gh search repos` 和直接 API 搜索等特定命令高效地搜索 GitHub 仓库、代码、问题和 PR，并提供精确的结果，同时利用 GitHub 的 API 处理复杂的查询。","ja":"エージェントが `gh search repos` や Direct API Search などの特定のコマンドを使用して GitHub リポジトリ、コード、問題、PR を効率的に検索し、正確な結果を提供し、複雑なクエリに対して GitHub の API を利用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `gh search repos` 및 직접 API 검색과 같은 특정 명령을 사용하여 GitHub 저장소, 코드, 문제 및 PR를 효율적으로 검색하고 정확한 결과를 제공하며 복잡한 쿼리에 대해 GitHub의 API를 활용할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a buscar eficientemente repositorios de GitHub, código, problemas e informes de problemas utilizando comandos específicos como `gh search repos` y Búsqueda de API directa, proporcionando resultados precisos y aprovechando la API de GitHub para consultas complejas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rechercher efficacement les référentiels GitHub, le code, les problèmes et les demandes de tirage en utilisant des commandes spécifiques comme `gh search repos` et Recherche d''API directe, fournissant des résultats précis et exploitant l''API GitHub pour des requêtes complexes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, GitHub-Repositorys, Code, Probleme und Pull-Requests effizient zu suchen, indem sie spezifische Befehle wie `gh search repos` und Direkte API-Suche verwenden, präzise Ergebnisse liefern und die GitHub-API für komplexe Abfragen nutzen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes procurem de forma eficiente repositórios do GitHub, código, problemas e PRs usando comandos específicos como `gh search repos` e Pesquisa de API Direta, fornecendo resultados precisos e utilizando a API do GitHub para consultas complexas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам эффективно искать репозитории GitHub, код, проблемы и PR по конкретным командам, таким как `gh search repos` и прямой поиск API, обеспечивая точные результаты и используя API GitHub для сложных запросов.","ar":"يمنح العملاء القدرة على البحث بفعالية في مستودعات GitHub والكود والمشكلات والطلبات سحب باستخدام أوامر محددة مثل `gh search repos` و بحث API المباشر ، مما يوفر نتائج دقيقة و tận dụng واجهة برمجة التطبيقات GitHub للاستفسارات المعقدة."},"useCases":{"en":["Searching repositories with specific keywords","Debugging issues using `gh search issues`","Finding relevant code snippets with `gh search code`"],"zh":["使用特定关键字搜索仓库","使用 `gh search issues` 调试问题","使用 `gh search code` 查找相关代码片段"],"ja":["特定のキーワードでリポジトリを検索する"," `gh search issues` を使用して問題をデバッグする"," `gh search code` を使用して関連するコードスニペットを探す"],"ko":["특정 키워드로 저장소를 검색한다","`gh search issues`를 사용하여 문제를 디버깅한다","`gh search code`를 사용하여 관련 코드 조각을 찾는다"],"es":["Buscar repositorios con palabras clave específicas","Depurar problemas utilizando `gh search issues`","Encontrar fragmentos de código relevantes con `gh search code`"],"fr":["Rechercher des référentiels avec des mots-clés spécifiques","Déboguer des problèmes en utilisant `gh search issues`","Trouver des extraits de code pertinents avec `gh search code`"],"de":["Repositorys mit bestimmten Schlüsselwörtern suchen","Probleme mit `gh search issues` debuggen","Relevante Code-Snippets mit `gh search code` finden"],"pt":["Procurar repositórios com palavras-chave específicas","Depurar problemas usando `gh search issues`","Encontrar trechos de código relevantes com `gh search code`"],"ru":["Поиск репозиториев с конкретными ключевыми словами","Отладка проблем с помощью `gh search issues`","Поиск релевантных фрагментов кода с помощью `gh search code`"],"ar":["البحث في المستودعات باستخدام الكلمات الرئيسية المحددة","تصحيح الأخطاء باستخدام `gh search issues`"," العثور على شذرات من الكود ذات الصلة باستخدام `gh search code`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Limited to 30 results per query by default"],"zh":["需要 GitHub API 访问","默认情况下每个查询最多返回 30 个结果"],"ja":["GitHub API アクセスが必要","デフォルトでは、クエリごとに最大 30 個の結果が返される"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요하다","기본적으로 쿼리당 최대 30개의 결과가 반환된다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","Limitado a 30 resultados por consulta de forma predeterminada"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Limité à 30 résultats par requête par défaut"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Standardmäßig auf 30 Ergebnisse pro Abfrage beschränkt"],"pt":["Requer acesso à API do GitHub","Limitado a 30 resultados por consulta por padrão"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к API GitHub","Ограничено 30 результатами на запрос по умолчанию"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة التطبيقات GitHub","محدود ب 30 نتيجة لكل استفسار افتراضي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"0bd94b4585b68dc19ed433deacd7586ac6724ce906eb76505e2804dd7e239003","qualityScore":42}');
