INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('kayistandhere/Career-Gap-Architect/nextjs-best-practices', 'nextjs-best-practices', 'kayistandhere', 'Career-Gap-Architect', 'community', 'nextjs-best-practices kayistandhere Career-Gap-Architect community The nextjs-best-practices skill provides developers with principles for Next.js App Router development, including decision trees for Server vs Client Components. This skill benefits Next.js developers looking to optimize their application''s performance. Next.js 最佳实践指南，帮助您优化应用性能和开发效率，包括 Server 和 Client 组件的选择 Next.js ベストプラクティスの設定方法を学び、Server と Client コンポーネントの選択を最適化する Next.js 베스트 프랙티스 설정 가이드, 애플리케이션 성능과 개발 효율을 최적화하는 데 도움이 됩니다 Next.js es un framework para desarrollar aplicaciones web de alta calidad. Nuestras mejores prácticas te ayudan a configurar y optimizar tus proyectos. Next.js est un framework pour développer des applications web de haute qualité. Nos bonnes pratiques vous aident à configurer et à optimiser vos projets. Next.js ist ein Framework für die Entwicklung von hochwertigen Webanwendungen. Unsere Best Practices helfen Ihnen, Ihre Projekte zu konfigurieren und zu optimieren. Desenvolva aplicações Next.js com eficiência usando Server e Client Components. Aprenda a decidir quando usar cada um Разрабатывайте приложения Next.js с помощью Server и Client Components. Узнайте, когда использовать каждый из них طور تطبيقات Next.js بفعالية باستخدام مكونات Server و Client. تعرف على كيفية تحديد الوقت المناسب لاستخدام كل منهما nextjs-best-practices setup guide how to use nextjs-best-practices nextjs-best-practices vs react what is nextjs-best-practices nextjs-best-practices alternative nextjs-best-practices install nextjs app router development server vs client components in nextjs optimizing nextjs application performance Next.js 最佳实践 Server 和 Client 组件 数据获取和布局优化 AI エージェント技能 Next.js 性能优化 开发效率提高 Decision tree for choosing between Server and Client Components Guidance on using ''use client'' for Client Components Default Server Component usage for data fetching and layout Splitting components into Server parent and Client child for optimal performance Usage of useState, useEffect, and event handlers in Client Components nextjs-best-practices is a set of guidelines for developing efficient Next.js applications, focusing on Server and Client Component decision-making');
