énements dans les composants client","Utilisation de chargement de données direct dans les composants serveur"],"de":["Verwendung von Server-Komponenten für Datenladung und Layout","Verwendung von Client-Komponenten für Formulare und interaktive Funktionen","Aufteilung von Komponenten in Server und Client für maximale Leistung","Verwendung von useState, useEffect und Ereignishandlern in Client-Komponenten","Verwendung von direktem Datenladen in Server-Komponenten"],"pt":["Uso de Server Components para busca de dados direta","Uso de Client Components para formulários e interação","Divisão de componentes em Server e Client para melhor desempenho","Uso de ''use client'' para componentes que necessitam de useState e useEffect","Uso de renderização estática para conteúdo não interativo"],"ru":["Использование Server Components для прямого получения данных","Использование Client Components для форм и взаимодействия","Разделение компонентов на Server и Client для лучшей производительности","Использование ''use client'' для компонентов, требующих useState и useEffect","Использование статической отрисовки для неинтерактивного контента"],"ar":["استخدام مكونات Server للبحث المباشر عن البيانات","استخدام مكونات Client للنماذج والتفاعل","تقسيم المكونات إلى Server و Client لتحسين الأداء","استخدام ''use client'' للمكونات التي تحتاج إلى useState و useEffect","استخدام إعادة التصيير الثابتة للمحتوى غير التفاعلي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use nextjs-best-practices","nextjs-best-practices setup guide","nextjs server vs client components","nextjs-best-practices alternative","nextjs-best-practices install","what is nextjs-best-practices","nextjs-best-practices tutorial","nextjs app router optimization","nextjs component placement best practices"],"zh":["Next.js 最佳实践","服务器组件","客户端组件","数据获取","交互性","静态内容","表单处理","事件处理","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Next.js ベストプラクティス","サーバーコンポーネント","クライアントコンポーネント","データ取得","インタラクティブ性","静的コンテンツ","フォーム処理","イベント処理","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Next.js 최고의 실践","서버 컴포넌트","클라이언트 컴포넌트","데이터 가져오기","상호작용","정적 콘텐츠","폼 처리","이벤트 처리","AI 도구"],"es":["mejores prácticas Next.js","desarrollo de aplicaciones Next.js","componentes del lado del servidor","componentes del lado del cliente","optimización de rendimiento Next.js","uso de useState y useEffect en Next.js"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques Next.js","développement d''applications Next.js","composants serveur","composants client","optimisation des performances Next.js","utilisation de useState et useEffect dans Next.js"],"de":["Next.js-Best Practices","Entwicklung von Next.js-Anwendungen","Server-Komponenten","Client-Komponenten","Leistungsoptimierung Next.js","Verwendung von useState und useEffect in Next.js"],"pt":["Next.js melhores práticas","Desenvolvimento de aplicações Next.js","Server Components","Client Components","Roteamento Next.js","Renderização estática","useState","useEffect"],"ru":["Лучшие практики для Next.js","Разработка приложений Next.js","Server Components","Client Components","Маршрутизация Next.js","Статическая отрисовка","useState","useEffect","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات ل Next.js","إنشاء تطبيقات Next.js","مكونات Server","مكونات Client","مسار Router Next.js","إعادة التصيير الثابتة","useState","useEffect","AI Tools"]}},"owner":"BWCbewchan","repo":"apprbt","repoPath":"BWCbewchan/apprbt","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-best-practices","description":"Next.js App Router principles. Server Components, data fetching, routing patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Form","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Forms, buttons, interactive UI |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Data Fetching Patterns\n\n### Fetch Strategy\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| **Default** | Static (cached at build) |\n| **Revalidate** | ISR (time-based refresh) |\n| **No-store** | Dynamic (every request) |\n\n### Data Flow\n\n| Source | Pattern |\n|--------|---------|\n| Database | Server Component fetch |\n| API | fetch with caching |\n| User input | Client state + server action |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Routing Principles\n\n### File Conventions\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `page.tsx` | Route UI |\n| `layout.tsx` | Shared layout |\n| `loading.tsx` | Loading state |\n| `error.tsx` | Error boundary |\n| `not-found.tsx` | 404 page |\n\n### Route Organization\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Route groups `(name)` | Organize without URL |\n| Parallel routes `@slot` | Multiple same-level pages |\n| Intercepting `(.)` | Modal overlays |\n\n---\n\n## 4. API Routes\n\n### Route Handlers\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| GET | Read data |\n| POST | Create data |\n| PUT/PATCH | Update data |\n| DELETE | Remove data |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Validate input with Zod\n- Return proper status codes\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Use Edge runtime when possible\n\n---\n\n## 5. Performance Principles\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n- Use next/image component\n- Set priority for above-fold\n- Provide blur placeholder\n- Use responsive sizes\n\n### Bundle Optimization\n\n- Dynamic imports for heavy components\n- Route-based code splitting (automatic)\n- Analyze with bundle analyzer\n\n---\n\n## 6. Metadata\n\n### Static vs Dynamic\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Static export | Fixed metadata |\n| generateMetadata | Dynamic per-route |\n\n### Essential Tags\n\n- title (50-60 chars)\n- description (150-160 chars)\n- Open Graph images\n- Canonical URL\n\n---\n\n## 7. Caching Strategy\n\n### Cache Layers\n\n| Layer | Control |\n|-------|---------|\n| Request | fetch options |\n| Data | revalidate/tags |\n| Full route | route config |\n\n### Revalidation\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| Time-based | `revalidate: 60` |\n| On-demand | `revalidatePath/Tag` |\n| No cache | `no-store` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Server Actions\n\n### Use Cases\n\n- Form submissions\n- Data mutations\n- Revalidation triggers\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Mark with ''use server''\n- Validate all inputs\n- Return typed responses\n- Handle errors\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| ''use client'' everywhere | Server by default |\n| Fetch in client components | Fetch in server |\n| Skip loading states | Use loading.tsx |\n| Ignore error boundaries | Use error.tsx |\n| Large client bundles | Dynamic imports |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Project Structure\n\n```\napp/\n├── (marketing)/     # Route group\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── (dashboard)/\n│   ├── layout.tsx   # Dashboard layout\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── api/\n│   └── [resource]/\n│       └── route.ts\n└── components/\n    └── ui/\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Server Components are the default for a reason. Start there, add client only when needed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:59:32.052Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing optimized Next.js component development and server-client architecture planning.","zh":"适用于需要优化Next.js组件开发和服务器-客户端架构规划的全栈代理","ja":"Next.jsコンポーネント開発とサーバー・クライアントアーキテクチャ計画を最適化する必要があるフルスタックエージェントに適しています","ko":"Next.js 컴포넌트 개발 및 서버-클라이언트 아키텍처 계획을 최적화하는 풀스택 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan un desarrollo de componentes de Next.js optimizado y una planificación de arquitectura servidor-cliente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack qui ont besoin d''un développement de composants Next.js optimisé et d''une planification d''architecture serveur-client.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die ein optimiertes Next.js-Komponenten-Entwicklung und eine Server-Client-Architektur-Planung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que necessitam de desenvolvimento de componentes Next.js otimizados e planejamento de arquitetura servidor-cliente.","ru":"Идеально подходит для полноценных агентов, которым необходим оптимизированный разработка компонентов Next.js и планирование архитектуры сервер-клиент.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الاستكمال الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير مكونات Next.js أمثلية وتخطيط بنية الخادم-العميل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to make informed decisions on component placement using decision trees, facilitating the use of server and client components in Next.js applications, and leveraging features like ''use client'' for client components and direct data fetching for server components.","zh":"赋予代理人使用决策树对组件位置做出明智的决定的能力，促进在Next.js应用程序中使用服务器和客户端组件，并利用诸如''使用客户端''用于客户端组件和直接数据获取用于服务器组件等功能","ja":"エージェントが決定木を使用してコンポーネントの配置に関する情報に基づいた決定を下すことができるようにし、Next.jsアプリケーションでサーバーとクライアントコンポーネントを使用するのを促進し、''クライアントを使用''などの機能を利用してクライアントコンポーネントとサーバーコンポーネントの直接データ取得を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 결정 트리를 사용하여 컴포넌트 위치에 대한 정보에 기반한 결정을 내릴 수 있도록 하며, Next.js 애플리케이션에서 서버 및 클라이언트 컴포넌트를 사용하는 것을 촉진하며 ''클라이언트 사용'' 등의 기능을 활용하여 클라이언트 컴포넌트 및 서버 컴포넌트의 직접 데이터 가져오기를实现합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a tomar decisiones informadas sobre la colocación de componentes utilizando árboles de decisión, facilitando el uso de componentes de servidor y cliente en aplicaciones Next.js y aprovechando características como ''use client'' para componentes de cliente y recuperación directa de datos para componentes de servidor.","fr":"Permet aux agents de prendre des décisions éclairées sur le placement des composants en utilisant des arbres de décision, facilitant l''utilisation de composants serveur et client dans les applications Next.js et exploitant des fonctionnalités comme ''use client'' pour les composants client et la récupération directe de données pour les composants serveur.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, fundierte Entscheidungen über die Komponentenplatzierung unter Verwendung von Entscheidungsbäumen zu treffen, wodurch die Verwendung von Server- und Client-Komponenten in Next.js-Anwendungen erleichtert wird und Funktionen wie ''use client'' für Client-Komponenten und direktes Datenabrufen für Server-Komponenten genutzt werden können.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a tomar decisões informadas sobre a colocação de componentes usando árvores de decisão, facilitando o uso de componentes de servidor e cliente em aplicações Next.js e aproveitando recursos como ''use client'' para componentes de cliente e busca direta de dados para componentes de servidor.","ru":"Позволяет агентам принимать обоснованные решения о размещении компонентов с помощью деревьев решений, облегчая использование серверных и клиентских компонентов в приложениях Next.js и использует функции, такие как ''use client'' для клиентских компонентов и прямую выборку данных для серверных компонентов.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من اتخاذ قرارات مستنيرة بشأن وضع المكونات باستخدام أشجار القرار، وتسهيل استخدام مكونات الخادم والعميل في تطبيقات Next.js واستخدام ميزات مثل ''use client'' للمكونات العميلية والاسترجاع المباشر للبيانات للمكونات الخادمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Determining optimal component placement for Next.js applications","Developing scalable server and client components","Implementing best practices for Next.js App Router development"],"zh":["确定Next.js应用程序的最佳组件位置","开发可扩展的服务器和客户端组件","实施Next.js应用程序路由器开发的最佳实践"],"ja":["Next.jsアプリケー