e","zh":"Next.js 最佳实践是指在开发 Next.js 应用程序时遵循的原则和方法，包括服务器和客户端组件的选择和使用","ja":"Next.js ベストプラクティスとは、Next.js アプリケーション開発時に従う原則と方法であり、サーバーとクライアントコンポーネントの選択と使用を含む","ko":"Next.js 베스트 프랙티스는 Next.js 애플리케이션 개발 시 따라야 할 원칙과 방법을 말하며, 서버 및 클라이언트 컴포넌트의 선택 및 사용을 포함합니다","es":"Las mejores prácticas de Next.js son principios para el desarrollo de aplicaciones web de alta calidad con Server y Client Components","fr":"Les meilleures pratiques de Next.js sont des principes pour le développement d''applications web de haute qualité avec des composants Server et Client","de":"Die besten Praktiken von Next.js sind Prinzipien für die Entwicklung von hochwertigen Webanwendungen mit Server- und Client-Komponenten","pt":"Next.js é uma estrutura JavaScript para desenvolver aplicações web renderizadas no servidor e no cliente","ru":"Next.js - это фреймворк JavaScript для разработки веб-приложений, отображаемых на сервере и клиенте для ИИ Агентов","ar":"Next.js هو إطار عمل جافاسكريبت لتطوير تطبيقات الويب التي تُ렌َدَر على الخادم والعميل لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Decision tree for choosing between server and client components","Server components for direct data fetching and layout","Client components for interactivity and form handling","Split components for combining server and client functionality","Support for ''use client'' directive for client components","Default server components for data fetching and static content"],"zh":["服务器组件（Server Component）和客户端组件（Client Component）的选择和使用","使用决策树确定组件类型","支持直接数据获取和无交互性组件","支持表单和交互性组件"],"ja":["サーバーコンポーネント（Server Component）とクライアントコンポーネント（Client Component）の選択と使用","決定ツリーを使用してコンポーネントタイプを決定する","直接データ取得と無交互性コンポーネントをサポート","フォームと交互性コンポーネントをサポート"],"ko":["서버 컴포넌트（Server Component）와 클라이언트 컴포넌트（Client Component）的 선택 및 사용","결정 트리를 사용하여 컴포넌트 유형을 결정","직접 데이터 가져오기 및 비 상호 작용 컴포넌트 지원","폼 및 상호 작용 컴포넌트 지원"],"es":["Uso de Server Components para la recuperación de datos","Uso de Client Components para la interactividad","División de componentes en Server y Client para optimizar el rendimiento","Uso de la directiva ''use client'' para los componentes del lado del cliente","Uso de la directiva por defecto para los componentes del lado del servidor"],"fr":["Utilisation de composants Server pour la récupération de données","Utilisation de composants Client pour l''interactivité","Division de composants en Server et Client pour optimiser les performances","Utilisation de la directive ''use client'' pour les composants côté client","Utilisation de la directive par défaut pour les composants côté serveur"],"de":["Verwendung von Server-Komponenten für die Datenabruf","Verwendung von Client-Komponenten für die Interaktivität","Aufteilung von Komponenten in Server und Client für die Leistungsoptimierung","Verwendung der Direktive ''use client'' für die Client-seitigen Komponenten","Verwendung der Standarddirektive für die Server-seitigen Komponenten"],"pt":["Uso de Server Components para busca de dados direta","Uso de Client Components para interação com o usuário","Divisão de componentes em Server e Client para melhor desempenho","Uso de useState e useEffect para gerenciamento de estado","Uso de event handlers para manipulação de eventos"],"ru":["Использование Server Components для прямого запроса данных","Использование Client Components для взаимодействия с пользователем","Разделение компонентов на Server и Client для лучшей производительности","Использование useState и useEffect для управления состоянием","Использование обработчиков событий для обработки событий"],"ar":["استخدام مكونات الخادم للبحث المباشر عن البيانات","استخدام مكونات العميل للتفاعل مع المستخدم","تقسيم المكونات إلى مكونات الخادم والعميل للحصول على أداء أفضل","استخدام useState و useEffect لإدارة الحالة","استخدام معالجات الأحداث لمعالجة الأحداث"]},"keywords":{"en":["nextjs-best-practices setup guide","how to use nextjs-best-practices","what is nextjs-best-practices","nextjs-best-practices vs react","nextjs-best-practices alternative","nextjs-best-practices install","nextjs app router development","server vs client components in nextjs","nextjs performance optimization"],"zh":["Next.js 最佳实践","服务器组件","客户端组件","决策树","直接数据获取","无交互性组件","表单","交互性组件"],"ja":["Next.js ベストプラクティス","サーバーコンポーネント","クライアントコンポーネント","決定ツリー","直接データ取得","無交互性コンポーネント","フォーム","交互性コンポーネント"],"ko":["Next.js 베스트 프랙티스","서버 컴포넌트","클라이언트 컴포넌트","결정 트리","직접 데이터 가져오기","비 상호 작용 컴포넌트","폼","상호 작용 컴포넌트"],"es":["Next.js","mejores prácticas","Server Components","Client Components","desarrollo de aplicaciones web","optimización del rendimiento","escalabilidad","Herramientas de desarrollo web"," Frameworks de desarrollo web"],"fr":["Next.js","meilleures pratiques","Composants Server","Composants Client","développement d''applications web","optimisation des performances","scalabilité","Outils de développement web","Frameworks de développement web"],"de":["Next.js","besten Praktiken","Server-Komponenten","Client-Komponenten","Entwicklung von Webanwendungen","Leistungsoptimierung","Skalierbarkeit","Webentwicklungstools","Webentwicklungsframeworks"],"pt":["nextjs melhores práticas","desenvolvimento de aplicações nextjs","server components nextjs","client components nextjs","useState nextjs","useEffect nextjs","event handlers nextjs"],"ru":["лучшие практики nextjs","разработка приложений nextjs","server components nextjs","client components nextjs","useState nextjs","useEffect nextjs","обработчики событий nextjs"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات ل nextjs","تطوير تطبيقات nextjs","مكونات الخادم nextjs","مكونات العميل nextjs","useState nextjs","useEffect nextjs","معالجات الأحداث nextjs"]}},"owner":"andymsun","repo":"lawvics","repoPath":"andymsun/lawvics","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.513Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nextjs-best-practices","description":"Next.js App Router principles. Server Components, data fetching, routing patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Form","body":"# Next.js Best Practices\n\n> Principles for Next.js App Router development.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Server vs Client Components\n\n### Decision Tree\n\n```\nDoes it need...?\n│\n├── useState, useEffect, event handlers\n│   └── Client Component (''use client'')\n│\n├── Direct data fetching, no interactivity\n│   └── Server Component (default)\n│\n└── Both? \n    └── Split: Server parent + Client child\n```\n\n### By Default\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| **Server** | Data fetching, layout, static content |\n| **Client** | Forms, buttons, interactive UI |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Data Fetching Patterns\n\n### Fetch Strategy\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| **Default** | Static (cached at build) |\n| **Revalidate** | ISR (time-based refresh) |\n| **No-store** | Dynamic (every request) |\n\n### Data Flow\n\n| Source | Pattern |\n|--------|---------|\n| Database | Server Component fetch |\n| API | fetch with caching |\n| User input | Client state + server action |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Routing Principles\n\n### File Conventions\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `page.tsx` | Route UI |\n| `layout.tsx` | Shared layout |\n| `loading.tsx` | Loading state |\n| `error.tsx` | Error boundary |\n| `not-found.tsx` | 404 page |\n\n### Route Organization\n\n| Pattern | Use |\n|---------|-----|\n| Route groups `(name)` | Organize without URL |\n| Parallel routes `@slot` | Multiple same-level pages |\n| Intercepting `(.)` | Modal overlays |\n\n---\n\n## 4. API Routes\n\n### Route Handlers\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| GET | Read data |\n| POST | Create data |\n| PUT/PATCH | Update data |\n| DELETE | Remove data |\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Validate input with Zod\n- Return proper status codes\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Use Edge runtime when possible\n\n---\n\n## 5. Performance Principles\n\n### Image Optimization\n\n- Use next/image component\n- Set priority for above-fold\n- Provide blur placeholder\n- Use responsive sizes\n\n### Bundle Optimization\n\n- Dynamic imports for heavy components\n- Route-based code splitting (automatic)\n- Analyze with bundle analyzer\n\n---\n\n## 6. Metadata\n\n### Static vs Dynamic\n\n| Type | Use |\n|------|-----|\n| Static export | Fixed metadata |\n| generateMetadata | Dynamic per-route |\n\n### Essential Tags\n\n- title (50-60 chars)\n- description (150-160 chars)\n- Open Graph images\n- Canonical URL\n\n---\n\n## 7. Caching Strategy\n\n### Cache Layers\n\n| Layer | Control |\n|-------|---------|\n| Request | fetch options |\n| Data | revalidate/tags |\n| Full route | route config |\n\n### Revalidation\n\n| Method | Use |\n|--------|-----|\n| Time-based | `revalidate: 60` |\n| On-demand | `revalidatePath/Tag` |\n| No cache | `no-store` |\n\n---\n\n## 8. Server Actions\n\n### Use Cases\n\n- Form submissions\n- Data mutations\n- Revalidation triggers\n\n### Best Practices\n\n- Mark with ''use server''\n- Validate all inputs\n- Return typed responses\n- Handle errors\n\n---\n\n## 9. Anti-Patterns\n\n| ❌ Don''t | ✅ Do |\n|----------|-------|\n| ''use client'' everywhere | Server by default |\n| Fetch in client components | Fetch in server |\n| Skip loading states | Use loading.tsx |\n| Ignore error boundaries | Use error.tsx |\n| Large client bundles | Dynamic imports |\n\n---\n\n## 10. Project Structure\n\n```\napp/\n├── (marketing)/     # Route group\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── (dashboard)/\n│   ├── layout.tsx   # Dashboard layout\n│   └── page.tsx\n├── api/\n│   └── [resource]/\n│       └── route.ts\n└── components/\n    └── ui/\n```\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Server Components are the default for a reason. Start there, add client only when needed.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:59:39.323Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing optimized Next.js application development with server and client components.","zh":"非常适合需要优化 Next.js 应用程序开发的前端代理，包括服务器和客户端组件。","ja":"Next.js アプリケーション開発の最適化が必要なフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。サーバー コンポーネントとクライアント コンポーネントが含まれます。","ko":"서버 및 클라이언트 컴포넌트를 포함한 Next.js 애플리케이션 개발을 최적화해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones optimizadas de Next.js con componentes de servidor y cliente.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un développement d''applications Next.js optimisé avec des composants serveur et client.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die optimierte Next.js-Anwendungsentwicklung mit Server- und Clientkomponenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de desenvolvimento de aplicações Next.js otimizado com componentes de servidor e cliente.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходим оптимизированный разработка приложений Next.js с компонентами сервера и клиента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تطبيق تطوير Next.js متكامل مع مكونات الخادم والعميل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop high-performance Next.js applications using App Router, leveraging server components for data fetching and layout, and client components for interactivity and form handling with useState, useEffect, and event handlers.","zh":"赋予代理开发人员使用 App Router 开发高性能 Next.js 应用程序的能力，利用服务器组件进行数据获取和布局，利用客户端组件进行交互性和表单处理，使用 useState、useEffect 和事件处理程序。","ja":"App Router を使用して高性能の Next.js アプリケーションを開発するエージェントをEmpowerします。サーバー コンポーネントを使用してデータ取得とレイアウトを行い、クライアント コンポーネントを使用してインタラクティブ性とフォーム処理を行い、useState、useEffect、イベント ハンドラーを使用します。","ko":"App Router를 사용하여 고성능 Next.js 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다. 서버 컴포넌트를 사용하여 데이터를 가져오고 레이아웃을 설정하며, 클라이언트 컴포넌트를 사용하여 상호 작용성 및 폼 처리를 수행하며, useState, useEffect 및 이벤트 처리기를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones Next.js de alto rendimiento utilizando App Router, aprovechando los componentes del servidor para la recuperación de datos y el diseño, y los componentes del cliente para la interactividad y el manejo de formularios con useState, useEffect y controladores de eventos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Next.js haute performance en utilisant App Router, en exploitant les composants serveur pour la récupération de données et la mise en page, et les composants client pour l''interactivité et la gestion de formulaires avec useState, useEffect et gestionnaires d''événements.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Next.js-Anwendungen mit hoher Leistung zu entwickeln, indem App Router verwendet wird, Serverkomponenten für Datenabruf und Layout sowie Clientkomponenten für Interaktivität und Formularhandling mit useState, useEffect und Ereignishandlern genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações Next.js de alto desempenho usando App Router, aproveitando componentes de servidor para busca de dados e layout, e componentes de cliente para interatividade e manipulação de formulários com useState, useEffect e manipuladores de eventos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью разработки высокопроизводительных приложений Next.js с использованием App Router,利用уя компоненты сервера для извлечения данных и макета, и компоненты клиента для интерактивности и обработки форм с useState, useEffect и обработчиками событий.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير تطبيقات Next.js عالية الأداء باستخدام App Router، واستخدام مكونات الخادم لاسترجاع البيانات والتخطيط، ومكونات العميل للتفاعل ومعالجة النماذج مع useState و useEffect ومعالجات الأحداث."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing Next.js application routing for better performance","Implementing server components for direct data fetching and static content","Developing interactive client components with useState and event handlers"],"zh":["为更好的性能而优化 Next.js 应用程序路由","实现服务器组件以直接获取数据和静态内容","使用 useState 和事件处理程序开发交互式客户端组件"],"ja":["パフォーマンスの向上のために Next.js アプリケーション ルーティングを最適化する","サーバー コンポーネントを実装してデータを直接取得し、静的コンテンツを取得する","useState とイベント ハンドラーを使用してインタラクティブなクライアント コンポーネントを開発する"],"ko":["より 좋은 성능을 위해 Next.js 애플리케이션 라우팅을 최적화하는 것","데이터를 직접 가져오고 정적 콘텐츠를 가져오기 위해 서버 컴포넌트를 구현하는 것","useState 및 이벤트 처리기를 사용하여 상호 작용형 클라이언트 컴포넌트를 개발하는 것"],"es":["Optimizar el enrutamiento de aplicaciones Next.js para un mejor rendimiento","Implementar componentes del servidor para la recuperación directa de datos y contenido estático","Desarrollar componentes del cliente interactivos con useState y controladores de eventos"],"fr":["Optimiser l''enrutamiento des applications Next.js pour de meilleures performances","Mettre en œuvre des composants serveur pour la récupération directe de données et de contenu statique","Développer des composants client interactifs avec useState et gestionnaires d''événements"],"de":["Optimieren des Next.js-Anwendungs-Routings für bessere Leistung","Implementieren von Serverkomponenten für direkten Datenabruf und statischen Inhalt","Entwickeln interaktiver Clientkomponenten mit useState und Ereignishandlern"],"pt":["Otimizar o roteamento de aplicações Next.js para melhor desempenho","Implementar componentes de servidor para busca de dados direta e conteúdo estático","Desenvolver componentes de cliente interativos com useState e manipuladores de eventos"],"ru":["Оптимизировать маршрутизацию приложений Next.js для лучшей производительности","Реализовать компоненты сервера для прямого извлечения данных и статического контента","Разрабатывать интерактивные компоненты клиента с useState и обработчиками событий"],"ar":["تحسين توجيه التطبيقات Next.js من أجل الأداء الأفضل","تطبيق مكونات الخادم لاسترجاع البيانات المباشر والمحتوى الثابت","تطوير مكونات العميل التفاعلية مع useState ومعالجات الأحداث"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Next.js and React","Limited to Next.js App Router development"],"zh":["需要 Next.js 和 React 的知识","仅限 Next.js App Router 开发"],"ja":["Next.js と React の知識が必要","Next.js App Router 開発のみ"],"ko":["Next.js 및 React에 대한 지식이 필요","Next.js App Router 개발만 해당"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Next.js y React","Limitado al desarrollo de Next.js App Router"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en Next.js et React","Limité au développement de Next.js App Router"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von Next.js und React","Begrenzt auf Next.js App Router-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de Next.js e React","Limitado ao desenvolvimento do Next.js App Router"],"ru":["Требует знания Next.js и React","Ограничен разработкой Next.js App Router"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Next.js و React","محدود بتطوير Next.js App Router"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"50bf04377ef5686f02884153c4115168ef2ec21b481bdac732c27389e4f3d3ef","qualityScore":42}');
