INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('andymsun/lawvics/nextjs-best-practices', 'nextjs-best-practices', 'andymsun', 'lawvics', 'community', 'nextjs-best-practices andymsun lawvics community The nextjs-best-practices skill provides principles for Next.js App Router development, helping developers optimize their applications with server and client components. It benefits developers building high-performance Next.js applications. Next.js 最佳实践指南，介绍服务器和客户端组件的开发原则和选择方法 Next.js ベストプラクティスガイド - サーバーとクライアントコンポーネントの開発原則と選択方法 Next.js 베스트 프랙티스 가이드 - 서버 및 클라이언트 컴포넌트 개발 원칙 및 선택 방법 Next.js es un framework para desarrollar aplicaciones web de alta calidad. Conoce las mejores prácticas para el desarrollo de App Router con Server y Client Components Next.js est un framework pour développer des applications web de haute qualité. Découvrez les meilleures pratiques pour le développement d''App Router avec des composants Server et Client Next.js ist ein Framework für die Entwicklung von hochwertigen Webanwendungen. Erfahren Sie die besten Praktiken für die Entwicklung von App Router mit Server- und Client-Komponenten Melhores práticas para desenvolver aplicações Next.js com Server e Client Components. Aprenda a usar useState, useEffect e event handlers. Лучшие практики для разработки приложений Next.js с использованием Server и Client Components. Узнайте, как использовать useState, useEffect и обработчики событий. أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات Next.js باستخدام مكونات الخادم والعميل. تعلم كيفية استخدام useState و useEffect ومعالجات الأحداث. nextjs-best-practices setup guide how to use nextjs-best-practices what is nextjs-best-practices nextjs-best-practices vs react nextjs-best-practices alternative nextjs-best-practices install nextjs app router development server vs client components in nextjs nextjs performance optimization Next.js 最佳实践 服务器组件 客户端组件 决策树 直接数据获取 无交互性组件 表单 交互性组件 Decision tree for choosing between server and client components Server components for direct data fetching and layout Client components for interactivity and form handling Split components for combining server and client functionality Support for ''use client'' directive for client components Default server components for data fetching and static content nextjs-best-practices is a set of guidelines for developing efficient Next.js applications using App Router, covering server and client components, and decision trees for optimal performance');
